r shitting itself with fear, nor calculating the precisely optimal mix of speed and stealth.<br /> <br /> \u201cWell that was fucking exciting.\u201d I looked at the pair of them once we\u2019d left the dam. \u201cLet\u2019s not invite her for fucking tea, OK?\u201d<br /> <br /> They nodded. \u201cI could watch her as spiders.\u201d Naomi offered, wincing. \u201cYou two still need Aether right, Billy more than ever?\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> Naomi watched over the Destroyer slash Guardian and her three lower ranked pals for three goddamn hours, while I drank and the g-man fucked his fish broad. We have them a bit of lead time and got away with ourselves and all our cell phones fucking full of juice. It was much easier this time. Good thing too, as not a goddamn one of us relished spending an extended amount of time there.<br /> <br /> With the delay, we had just enough time to grab a quick fucking bite to eat before our scheduled exorcism. Naomi swapped back to Liz, and she of the delicate fucking palate pulled some goddamn strings and \u2018time enough for the diner\u2019 became \u2018time enough for VIP service\u2019 at one of her usual haunts.<br /> <br /> <b><br /> Clytemnestra\u2019s Yarns</b><br /> <br /> The past couple days have not been bad but have had harrowing moments. Pour me a glass?<br /> <br /> Thank you Darling.<br /> <br /> Monday was by and large uneventful, which is to say a very good day for me to really begin to explore Naomi\u2019s life. The morning was spent in my useless math class, mostly pissing off my teacher. I am glad I only need one math class. Once that was finally done I met up with the others and started scoping out the other of White\u2019s locations he sent Drake\u2026neither of which was the trap the damaged building was. One was an abandoned building being used for some sort of street fighting ring. The other was a theater a couple Mothmen took refuge in. I activated my sensory suite and had a look but nothing too serious there.