lly.<br /> <br /> Billy Mack nodded seriously. \u201cI also learned that a Eugene Thompson, formerly of Team Tomorrow, currently only consulting for them while working at Seattle Children\u2019s Hospital, is supplying about one third to one half of the employees there with meth, At least according to the memories of the nurse I was borrowing.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019m sure we\u2019ll look into it.\u201d Liz looked back over her shoulder. \u201cLook, I\u2019m feeling like I need emotional detachment, so I\u2019m going to be Naomi for awhile, I just want to talk to Gabe first.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cIs there something I can help with?\u201d Billy Mack asked.<br /> <br /> She smiled at him. \u201cThere\u2019s no problem, I\u2019m just processing.\u201d<br /> <br /> He nodded. \u201cI believe she went to visit Miranda last night.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cNo rush. I\u2019ll be in my office.\u201d She turned to go.<br /> <br /> \u201cHow is Kayla?\u201d<br /> <br /> Liz stopped, a smile on her face, and turned back around. \u201cHappier than ever in her life and remarkably alive. An excellent main course, and will remain so.\u201d<br /> <br /> Billy Mack smiled back. \u201cSustainability is important.\u201d<br /> <br /> Liz held onto the door frame. \u201cI feel the need to cry. I\u2019m going upstairs before I do.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWe,\u201d Billy Mack paused, \u201care upstairs.\u201d<br /> <br /> Liz laughed lightly. \u201cWe are, aren\u2019t we? I\u2019m going to my office.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019ll be sure to send Gabe your way if I run into her.\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> I was mid sip, not five fucking steps from the goddamn second floor stairwell at the office when Liz pounced on me. She grabbed my wrist and pulled me eagerly into her office. \u201cAfter earlier, I thought we should talk. Kayla and I are a couple now.\u201d<br /> <br /> I leaned against the door frame and finished that sip. \u201cSwell.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cIt\u2019s complicated. We spent some time last night talking about how this affects our covers. I mean, really it\u2019s Ms. Liquor and Clytemnestra who are a couple. Kayla and Liz are having an affair. Both Naomi and Liz will have their things. But this is something real.\u201d She was positively fucking glowing. \u201cIt is wonderful being a Demon with no refractory period.\u201d<br /> <br /> I leered at her. \u201cI bet.\u201d<br /> <br /> She rolled her eyes at me. \u201cAnd how about you? Billy Mack said you were at Miranda\u2019s\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI had the talk last night.\u201d I spun the spare chair around and sat in it backwards. \u201cShe took it well, I think.\u201d I rubbed my eyes and sighed heavily, flipping my flask around in my other hand. \u201cBut... cleansing her might fucking kill her.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOh Gabe.\u201d She took my hand. \u201cWe\u2019re not going to let that happen.\u201d I ran my tongue over my teeth and looked away. Liz changed the subject. \u201cSo, I\u2019m needing detachment from the intense feelings of this last day with a little Naomi. Kayla is better off, was better prepared, so she\u2019s OK.\u201d She smiled at me. \u201cYou\u2019d know I was hiding, so I wanted to make sure you knew everything was alright.\u201d<br /> <br /> I winked at her, stood up and stretched. \u201cThanks doll.\u201d<br /> <br /> We headed out of her office, checking in on Billy Mack. He was ordering flowers online and spun her chair around as we entered the lab. Jack looked over as well.<br /> <br /> \u201cI plan on checking out Adria and the other girl. And trying to get that blood sample from Dr. Cross.\u201d Liz had a daydreamy half-smile on her face.<br /> <br /> \u201cIf there proves to be difficulty with that, I should be able to ascertain if Dr. Cross is tainted with a simple touch,\u201d the g-man offered.<br /> <br /> Liz waved him aside. \u201cOh... the gauntlet\u2019s been thrown for Naomi. If Cross were straight it would be one th