lked in, her arms crossed low, holding her wrist. \u201cI\u2019m headed back to Olympia but I wanted to say thanks. You...\u201d She looked away for a moment, \u201chelped a lot and I think you saved my life. Is there anything I can do for you, other than mix a fuckload of drinks?\u201d She smiled.<br /> <br /> \u201cThat sounds fucking grand to me.\u201d I shrugged. \u201cJust take care of yourself. Clytemnestra wouldn\u2019t like it if some other goddamn predator got you.\u201d<br /> <br /> She gave me a fucking wry look and a card. \u201cSeriously, I owe you a favor.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSure thing doll.\u201d<br /> <br /> I watched her leave, walking to my door to get a better view. Then I poured myself a glass of rye and started in on paperwork again. At least, I fucking tried to. Cannon\u2019s case files sat on the edge of my desk, taunting me. I flipped through it and then got back up again.<br /> <br /> The fixer and the g-man were still in the lab. \u201cLook, I was thinking...\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cDon\u2019t give yourself a headache.\u201d<br /> <br /> I flipped Jack off. \u201cDrake, right? We\u2019re waiting on word from Crusher?\u201d Jack nodded. \u201cI think we should move without them. Maybe see if we could trade something, someone.\u201d I brushed my hair back with my fingers. \u201cI don\u2019t like the idea of working with the motherfucker, but I\u2019ll negotiate with goddamn terrorists to get my man.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWhat do we have to trade?\u201d Jack leaned back in her chair.<br /> <br /> \u201cThe Guardian?\u201d Billy Mack suggested. \u201cWe could possibly convince Clytemnestra to take him alive. Recall, it has to be significant enough to bargain for Drake and Vivian.\u201d<br /> <br /> Jack nodded eagerly. \u201cIf we're planning on going in hot, we can pilfer some Infrastructure on the way out too.\u201d<br /> <br /> I raised an eyebrow. \u201cI was gonna also suggest we could sneak or some shit, but the plan is getting 