 a vivacious thing once you strip away all the decorum and shoulds. I really must thank you for, well, making my approach possible. Believe me when I say I would not have been able to do it without you.<br /> <br /> Of course you can sleep with her again soon.<br /> <br /> There are a few things I need you or someone you trust to do:<br /> <br /> Adria has a blonde friend, tattoos, fairly attractive. I want you to find out everything you easily can about her. I do not think she is student. Don\u2019t directly approach her, or clue Adria in to what you are doing.<br /> <br /> Make sure Angela and Dr. Cross don\u2019t sleep with anyone until this is dealt with. Also, but probably easier, make sure they don\u2019t trade blood or organs or anything like that. I don\u2019t think that is going to happen, but I don\u2019t want any intimate contact from them to anyone.<br /> <br /> Keep an eye on Dr. Stein. If he does anything odd or having to do with the room, report him. Don\u2019t approach him. If he seems onto you contact me immediately.<br /> <br /> Finally, when we cleanse it, an Asian woman with green hair and a large chest will be with us. Do what you can to keep her back from the site. Don\u2019t worry about what she tells you. She is not to get close to ground zero. She won\u2019t hurt you I promise.<br /> <br /> Good girl. I foresee great things in your future. In fact\u2026<br /> <br /> \u2026Hold on that\u2019s Naomi\u2019s phone.<br /> <br /> Sup Dee? Yea Babe hanging with Cass.<br /> <br /> Nah sweetie course I got time for you I just\u2026<br /> <br /> ..c\u2019mon baby\u2026I haven\u2019t been scarce\u2026school keeps me busy y\u2019know\u2026<br /> <br /> \u2026fine. I will see if I can get out of my plans. But I just had to stand people up yesterday to get stuff done.<br /> <br /> Yea you know you do babe.<br /> <br /> Bye!<br /> <br /> So, I just totally ruined the mystique didn\u2019t I.<br /> <br /> Yea, that\u2019s my life recently. Anyway, be careful out there Cassandra. We are not\u2026<br /> <br /> DAMNIT. Go on I\u2019ll just have to handle some more calls.<br /> <br /> Not funny.<br /> <br /> Okay maybe a little funny\u2026.<br /> <br /> <i>End Session XXVIII</i><br /> <br /> So there may have been some light Mage fudging for Drama. Should work overall.<br /> I gave Kilroy\u2019s player the option on using Possession. There seem to be 10 people here. So you have a 10% chance to get Overseer. Pick high or low. He picked high, and I rolled a 94, so he got Overseer.<br /> <br /> So how will dealing with the Gentry go? Will the Changelings find out? That we will have to wait for for next time.<br /> <br /> Comments and Questions welcome","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T23:58:39-07:00","id":743916,"title":"","content":"Some of the feedback I get on the forums are from PMs or discussions outside the forum threads where the games are discussed. A number of them can be applied pretty broadly to my games, so I paraphrased some and put some info down here to \u201cdraw back the curtain\u201d as it were as I thought some would be of interest to some readers. Add your own if you wish, as always.<br /> <br /> <b>You have a lot of female characters in your games. Like, most of them. Is this on purpose?</b><br /> <br /> Yes, yes I do. Some of it is deliberate. Media is all about men, and many TV shows, movies, books and, honestly, role-playing campaigns have few females that are often lovers, prizes, victims or relatives. I try to make women who fit every conceivable role, but have many male characters too.<br /> <br /> At the same time, I just come up with female characters more easily, and since I cull pictures from the internet which provide inspiration for PCs, the fact that I have way more female pictures means I get inspired for female characters more often. That is not deliberate, just the way it turns out.<br /> <br /> <b>How about LGBTQ characters? Same?</b><br /> <br /> Most NPCs are actually Herosexual. With a few exceptions such as Cassandra Bale or Harvey Cannon most NPCs orientation is such that they would be interested in PCs interested in them. Those with exceptions are NPCs whose concept defines their sexuality, and they are rare. Then sometimes as I see them in action NPCs seem to make good couples or drift together. I have no bias to create gay or straight couples this way. It just happens. However, see above that women outnumber men. I am proud, however, of the queer representation in my games.<br /> <br /> Of course, just because an NPC could fall for a PC of either sex does not mean they are equally easy to woo. Robin Graves could go either way but is easier for men, for example.<br /> <br /> <b>No gay male relationships with PCs, but there are several lesbians\u2026</b><br /> <br /> I don\u2019t tell my players what orientation to make their PCs. If a male character wants to have a relationship with a male NPC that\u2019s fine (it even happened in my <i>Masquerade</i> game) but it is what the players want.<br /> <br /> <b>You have less Trans characters than I expected.</b><br /> <br /> Yea, not so impressive regarding those numbers. Kiki (the ghost in Kiki\u2019s bar) is actually trans, but has not actually appeared yet.<br /> <br /> <b>You have a lot of, um, sex in your game. Is everyone okay with it?</b><br /> <br /> Yes, yes I do. I will speak plainly. Sex for me is way more interesting than violence. I\u2019d be more interested in seeing a PC having a torrid affair than a gunfight. This does not mean my games are without action; <i>The Golden Eagle</i> has a setting conceit allowing for more danger and daring-do since the conceit prevents a PC revolving door. There is more action there than other games. <i>Night Train Detective Agency</i> has more action than <i>Balance of Shadows</i> or <i>Malibu Dream House</i>, because it is spy-noir, while <i>The Golden Eagle</i> is part noir, part mystery, part pulp. But yes, relationships are a huge thing.<br /> <br /> My players know this, and new players are told before they join. No player has to play romantic relationships, straight or queer.<br /> <br /> For the record, we almost always fade to black unless there is a good reason not to, and sex is only rolled if something besides having a good time is going on, such as getting a foe vulnerable, staying awake so the PC can rummage through their partners stuff, staying awake so their partner can\u2019t rummage through theirs, impressing a countess, etc.<br /> <br /> <b>So everyone has pictures, can I see a picture of [NPC]?</b><br /> <br /> Probably. If it is a picture culled from the internet and you want to see an NPC, I will show it unless I am using the picture with particular permission of the photographer or model, in which case no because they have not given me permission for that.<br /> <br /> <b>How many of your players are women/lesbian/bisexual/giraffes/etc</b><br /> <br /> I am not going to give out too much information on my players. I will say every game linked in my sig has a mix of male and female and straight and LGBTQ players. Most games hover somewhere close to 50/50 male female, or one more of one or the other. <i>The Golden Eagle</i> is the exception, with many more women than men. I will tell you, if you have read about a female PC having relationships with female NPCs in these games and assumed they are being played by a guy you will be wrong much more often than not.<br /> <br /> <b>Do Players plan their PCs relationships before the game starts?</b><br /> <br /> Not usually. Sometimes they have an idea getting together is likely. Though it was not a factor in <i>Night Train Detective Agency</i><br /> <br /> <b>What genre would you call your games</b><br /> <br /> Mystery/Supernatural Drama. <i>Balance of Shadows</i> has ghost story elements. <i>Night Train Detective Agency</i> has noir and spy elements, and <i>The Golden Eagle</i> has noir, pulp, and mystery. <i>Malibu Dream House</i> is more pure mystery-drama.<br /> <br /> <b>Can I play in your game?</b><br /> <br /> Probably not. If you live in North Carolina we can discuss it, but even then probably not. My games are almost all full.<br /> <br /> Stay tuned for regular journals return next week, with the raid on the Water Wheel.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":56,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","user":"Baroness Nerak","date":". 10-31-2015, 03:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-31T03:35:30-07:00","id":744141,"title":"","content":"As Kilroy's player, I can add a bit of my thought processes concerning his sexual activities and relationships.<br /> <br /> I think the key is that Kilroy does not really identify as male or female because Kilroy does not consider himself human. Kilroy is a quantum being with projections that are human and thus generally male or female. Billy Mack is male. Vivian is female. Kilroy views it as simply a matter of form and what can be done in that particular form. Kilroy has found sex as both to be enjoyable and the differences in having sex with a female as one as opposed to as a male are an interesting diversity. I've actually debated pronoun use for Kilroy but 'it' implies a lack of gender which isn't accurate and as he doesn't think of his covers as distinct individuals Kilroy isn't a plural being. (I've actually thought about that one and kinda want to play a demon that does at some point) But the male pronouns are more default than gender specific. And while Kilroy hasn't had sex with another male as Billy Mack, it's more that the situation hasn't really come up. It is likely his next cover will be a younger and more attractive male better suited to sexual activities. <br /> <br /> This is part of why Kilroy has had some issues with Clytemnestra. He just doesn't see the distinction in covers she does and he doesn't think of humans as being the same as he and his fellow Unchained. Basically, as far as he's concerned, Shelly and Casey are both in love with a suit of clothes and as humans may not be capable of handling the truth.. This is colored by the fact that Vivian was human and ultimately could not deal with knowing the full truth of the God Machine and what he was. Kilroy did love Vivian even if he was not really 'in love' with her.<br /> <br /> So, basically he does feel affection for Shelly but honestly sees her as a lesser being. He likes her and wants her to be happy and healthy and enjoys playing with her.She is important to him but she isn't 'people' She's a toy. <br /> <br /> Casey is an indulgence. The poor boy was clearly smitten by Vivian and Kilroy has enjoyed teasing him. It would be difficult to maintain a relationship with him and Shelly simultaneously but such strong attraction is too useful to be discarded. Kilroy is working on finding a use for the boy that justifies the time and energy spent on keeping him around. He's a tool.<br /> <br /> And then there is Ganora. Ganora is the mother of his child and the leader of his cult. She's not a demon, but she's already shown that she can handle the mental stress of knowing how things work. She's important and valuable. She is sensually pleasing. She is, without question, Kilroy's favorite. She's the pet that gets to be on the table and eat off his plate. She's almost people. She is the only one that he'd consider choosing over one of the other demons if it came down to it. <br /> <br /> Now, Kilroy is a guardian, so he takes very good care of his toys, tools, and pets. He doesn't really grok the way the others treat their humans, but that's their business. He's not going to let anyone lay a finger on Speed's car or her woman without stopping them. If either is broken, he's going to try to fix it. Miranda isn't people, but she is important to Speed and that makes her important to Kilroy.<br /> <br /> Also, I would like to say, I truly love how Speed's player portrays Kilroy in Speed's journals. Thank you for the awesome writing.<br /> <br /> And if that isn't already more than you wanted to know about Kilroy, I am more than happy to answer questions. I love talking about my characters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4217-amberghylles","name":"Amberghylles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4217_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-07T15:25:13-08:00","id":760265,"title":"","content":"The PCs just need to raid the Water Wheel, capture the Angel, process the material, and rip out some infrastructure.<br /> <br /> Seriously, what could go wrong?<br /> <br /> Note Kilroy\u2019s journal covers the last two sessions.<br /> <br /> <i>Session XXIX</i><br /> <br /> <b>Speed Demon\u2019s Monologues</b><br /> <br /> I was done with my goddamn dinner at Johnny\u2019s and Billy Mack had had plenty of fucking time to design the virus and arrange a cell phone blackout with Vivian\u2019s contacts by the time Naomi breezed the hell in wearing an \u2018Of course your girlfriend doesn\u2019t secretly prefer me <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />\u2019 t-shirt, pants that could fit two of her, and a goddamn smirk.<br /> <br /> Billy Mack glanced up when he heard her come in. \u201cI trust you got the blood sample/\u201d<br /> <br /> Naomi presented a vial filled with a dark liquid with a fucking flourish. \u201cYup!\u201d<br /> <br /> Billy Mack took the sample and began running his goddamn tests. After a moment he frowned. \u201cInteresting. She has even higher levels of taint than Angela.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cGiven that we know what that particular crazy did to get tainted, what the hell has Dr. Cross done?\u201d Jack made a face like a goddamn Mother Superior at a fucking wet t-shirt contest.<br /> <br /> I gave him a sideways look. \u201cSo, her thing with Dr. Fisher and Angela - is it jealousy?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cShe doesn\u2019t seem the type.\u201d Naomi shook her head. \u201cAnd I\u2019ve seen a couple of different sides of her personality by now.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cIt could simply be that she has witnessed more and is therefore more aware of the danger,\u201d Billy Mack suggested.<br /> <br /> \u201cYeah!\u201d Naomi pointed at him. \u201cLike the dad who smokes a pack a day, but slaps the cigarettes away from his kids.\u201d<br /> <br /> Billy Mack nodded. \u201cIndeed. The instinct to keep one\u2019s charges from one\u2019s own debilitating addiction does not always assist with curing the addiction itself.\u201d<br /> <br /> Naomi shrugged. \u201cSpeaking of Angela, she\u2019s having to be physically restrained again. She\u2019s feeling unwell, being away from the Room for so long.\u201d Her thoughts seemed to be elsewhere.<br /> <br /> \u201cWithdrawal symptoms? Or more directly tied to the taint?\u201d Jack asked.<br /> <br /> Billy Mack waved the question the hell aside. \u201cIt is largely irrelevant at this point. The first priority remains to cleanse the taint.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI think the taint is all that Angela\u2019s problem is,\u201d Naomi mused. \u201cDr. Cross, on the other hand... I don\u2019t think her self loathing is all the taint\u2019s fault. Part of it is that she likes girls, but I don\u2019t think that\u2019s all either.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAh, she has a lack of comfort with her sexuality. That is unfortunate.\u201d Billy Mack stored the fucking vial in a cabinet labeled in Yi.<br /> <br /> Naomi smirked. \u201cOh boy, does she. Like I said, that\u2019s not all, but man, it made it easy to play her right into bed. Just the tiniest riff on how horrible and degraded it was, and what a betrayal of trust...\u201d<br /> <br /> I raised a goddamn eyebrow. \u201cWait - was this because you\u2019re a dame or because you\u2019re a student?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cMorally, because I\u2019m a girl. Ethically, because I\u2019m a student. Desperate guilt was wrapped up in just everything.\u201d Her lips quirked. \u201cI couldn\u2019t show her I\u2019m a spider - she\u2019d probably try to off herself. I have someone following her around anyway. I do believe, once this Room shit is all over, I\u2019ll have to help her over that.\u201d She thought for a fucking moment. \u201cWell, Liz will. Naomi doesn\u2019t give a shit. Not like I can\u2019t arrange for them to meet.\u201d<br /> <br /> Billy Mack smiled. \u201cWe do have ways to figure out <u><u>why</u></u> she hates herself, so you should be able to help significantly.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOh! Before I forget and before I do anymore muff diving -\u201d She stuck her arm out.<br /> <br /> \u201cThe hell?\u201d Jack asked.<br /> <br /> Billy Mack took a blood sample from the outstretched arm without fucking answering and ran his tests. \u201cYou are slightly tainted. Not so much that you yourself will spread it to others.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cGood. I don\u2019t want to be some kind of Typhoid Mary of Abyssal taint.\u201d She leaned back against the wall. \u201cSo... when we heading out?\u201d<br /> <br /> Billy cleared his throat. \u201cBefore we do... we\u2019ve been in contact with Mr. Smiles.\u201d He paused. \u201cWe promised him the Angel.\u201d<br /> <br /> She stared at him goddamn uncomprehendingly. \u201cWhat?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYou have considerable self control, more than you give yourself credit for,\u201d Billy Mack buttered her up.<br /> <br /> \u201cBut... but I <u><u>just</u></u> didn\u2019t eat Kayla.\u201d<br /> <br /> Jack smirked. \u201cSo you\u2019ve got practice not eating this one.\u201d<br /> <br /> She glared at him, then at Billy Mack. \u201cCan\u2019t we find another one to trade?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWhere would you suggest we do that?\u201d Billy Mack held her gaze fucking levelly.<br /> <br /> \u201cI...\u201d She sighed. \u201cI don\u2019t know.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWe\u2019ll be meeting him tomorrow at dawn, to potentially trade an Angel for an end to his attentions, as well as to definitely pick up the simulacrum we will use to convince the Changelings that Mr. Smiles is dead in exchange for Drake. A protected parlay.\u201d There was a goddamn warning in Billy Mack\u2019s eyes.<br /> <br /> Naomi rolled hers. \u201cSo I can\u2019t eat him either?\u201d When Billy Mack paused, she punched the fucking wall. After a moment, Cecilia looked into the room and slapped Naomi with a rolled up newspaper, glaring at her disapprovingly. Naomi sneered at her.<br /> <br /> Billy Mack tried again. \u201cWe needed to exchange something of similar value. It seemed best.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWithout my consent...\u201d Naomi began.<br /> <br /> I interrupted her. \u201cLook doll, this Mr Smiles bullshit is a sword of fucking Damocles. You\u2019re not going to starve, right?\u201d I spread my arms questioningly.<br /> <br /> She looked away and shook her head. \u201cLet\u2019s get it over with then.\u201d<br /> <br /> As we were leaving, Cecilia caught Naomi\u2019s eye and started berating her in Portuguese. \u201cI didn\u2019t catch all that, but if you are hungry, go eat somewhere better for you.\u201d She patted Naomi\u2019s thighs and turned to the rest of us, continuing in English. \u201cI am sorry she is behaving so poorly today.\u201d<br /> <br /> I waved her apologies aside and winked at Naomi. \u201cNah, kids will be goddamn kids, She does good fucking work.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cJust so long as.\u201d Cecilia looked fucking pointedly at Naomi, who rolled her eyes again.<br /> <br /> <br /> We left the car the hell downriver of the water wheel and hoofed it the fuck back. Quietus still reeked like a goddamn welding accident, so we left him eying the security guard.<br /> <br /> Clytemnestra scattered like a shot as soon as she shifted quantum states, fucking swarms of spiders flowing towards the facility. A few stayed behind, tucking themselves into the bark of a tree behind Quietus\u2019 head. Kilroy transformed into his fully aquatic form and fell into the river once she was off and I followed behind, wading out into the fucking river before transforming.<br /> <br /> The oppressive rhythmic goddamn thumping of the water wheel and the clinging darkness fucking got to me as we made our way into the facility. It occurred to me that for the second goddamn time in as many days we were going right the hell into an Infrastructure, a pretty fucking important one from the looks of it. I was used to running headlong into whatever the hell was coming, sense of goddamn self preservation be damned, but it wasn\u2019t just me anymore. There was Miranda now, the woman I loved, the woman I just fucking told about the goddamned God Machine and then left alone for a day. What if the fucker caught wind of her research and that clued it in that she knew more than she should? What if that gave it the piece it needed to know where we were hitting?<br /> <br /> Billy Mack signaled a stop and reformed to climb out once he confirmed there was no one around. I couldn\u2019t very well call shit off right then, so I followed along behind him, playing fucking lookout.<br /> <br /> There wasn\u2019t a whole lot to look at, except for one fresh fucking face. He was tall and well built - another Cambodian worker, one whose skin was covered with goddamn circuitry patterns. Definitely would have noticed those fuckers before. He wore a ballistic vest under a muscle shirt and loose fitting pants. He was clearly a stigmatic, though what powers he had aside from seeing in the dark were not immediately fucking obvious. He was patrolling the active part of the facility only, so we didn\u2019t have to worry about him too much in the back room production area.<br /> <br /> After about fifteen minutes in their computer system, Billy Mack let me know in quiet tones to load the materials into the fucking machine. He kept at the computer, even plugging into the goddamn thing. The production cycle was almost done when he jacked back out and turned to me and the quintet of spiders idly making webs on my resistors. \u201cThis Infrastructure primarily serves as one of two major facilities moving power to a particular Command and Control Infrastructure. It is producing much more power than the lynchpin water wheel accounts for thanks to a hidden torture chamber with machinery designed to extract Essence from pain.\u201d<br /> <br /> My gears tightened. My rig had been small fucking peanuts compared to this place, and Essence wasn\u2019t going to be the end product of my efforts as far as I knew but... pain isn\u2019t that goddamn far off from despair. Before I could grill the g-man about it, Naomi\u2019s voice whispered in our ears. \u201cThe stigmatic cult leader believes hurting Demons, specifically, will give him Essence - he has a strong desire to electrocute one.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThat is certainly possible, given the proper modifications.\u201d Kilroy turned back to the computer. \u201cIf I deciphered this correctly, it does appear that the Deacon of Agony is a cult leader who has the proper ones.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cFucking great.\u201d I spun my wheels. \u201cOK, new plan -we start this party by filling lightning boy full of lead.\u201d<br /> <br /> Kilroy shrugged and began uploading his virus into the system. The spiders began to surreptitiously gather near the computer terminal we calculated was most fucking likely to spit out the Guardian after he was infected, while I relayed the plan to Quietus over the radio. After the production had finished and the vials of medicine were safely tucked the hell away in Kilroy\u2019s chest c