rming in too, and she doesn\u2019t. Have friends period, really. Even Adria\u2019s scared of her I think. She was quite rude to her.<br /> <br /> I smirked. \u201cThat\u2019s not very Canadian.\u201d<br /> <br /> Liz groaned. \u201cOh god, it\u2019s so hard. Naomi wants in her pants so bad, but... Jesus.\u201d She paused. \u201cAnyway. Important things. I can\u2019t put the girls in more danger. I need to put Angela somewhere else.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThat is problematic. There\u2019s a fucking decided lack of goddamn secure holding facilities available to us.\u201d I started walking a coin across my knuckles.<br /> <br /> \u201cThere is the Web,\u201d Liz offered fucking tentatively.<br /> <br /> I tapped the coin on the table. \u201cThat\u2019s about it, but I wasn\u2019t gonna offer you to get fucking involved. Possession will make it a hell of a fuckton safer - she won\u2019t remember how she got there or back, and you can fuck with her as Naomi only.\u201d<br /> <br /> She thought for a goddamn moment. \u201cThat does sound best. Let me conference call Kilroy in.\u201d It rang twice before Angela picked up. \u201cMy aloof buddy?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYes,\u201d Angela answered in fucking Sentinelese.<br /> <br /> \u201cWe\u2019re thinking of leaving Angela in the Web. There are too many coincidences going on here for my comfort,\u201d Liz began.<br /> <br /> Angela nodded. \u201cI was going to suggest relocating myself. I should see what information this Andrew will give to the girl he was so worried about first.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cRight, but after - can you hot wire your car, or do you need a ride?\u201d<br /> <br /> I broke in. \u201cNo, she needs to leave under her own goddamn power. It\u2019s not going to help anyone out if they find out someone drove her the hell away and she fucking disappears again for a few days.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAngela has her own car and I have her keys presently. I can even spread around the story that Angela is going out of town for a few days.\u201d Angela smiled and waved at some friends on the way to class.<br /> <br /> \u201cMake sure to tell Am. She\u2019d spread the story just because I told her to, but she\u2019s a horrible liar. I\u2019ll summon her here to meet you when you\u2019re done with Andrew. Then you drive to the Web and we\u2019re good?\u201d She sounded fucking hopeful.<br /> <br /> I finished my goddamn drink. \u201cNot quite. She should drop the car off in long term parking some fucking where, to sell the goddamn story. One of us can pick her up there, so long as no one follows.\u201d<br /> <br /> Liz nodded. \u201cI will. I would have needed to meet her at the Web anyway, to set up the entertainment so she doesn\u2019t get stir crazy. In the right mind, she\u2019ll agree to whatever I say.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOh I know what she\u2019ll agree to.\u201d Angela fucking smirked.<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019m ignoring that,\u201d Liz said archly, \u201cnot that I\u2019m ashamed of anything.\u201d<br /> <br /> Angela smiled. \u201cNot even the fanfic?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThe Hermione/Umbridge slash fic with BDSM overtones was about power, not sex.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI was talking about the writing, not the subject matter,\u201d Angela rejoined.<br /> <br /> I cringed away from the phone as Drake came back with my whiskey sour and his Dr. Pepper. \u201cSomething wrong?\u201d<br /> <br /> I rested my forehead on my hand. \u201cJesus fuck, the people I work with.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019m afraid I don\u2019t have that kind of relationship with the God Machine.\u201d Angela raised a goddamn eyebrow.<br /> <br /> \u201cAh, come on, just ask Naomi, fucking someone\u2019s kid is the best way to give them the finger.\u201d Drake gave me a look. I shrugged.<br /> <br /> Liz put on her fucking dignity. \u201cI\u2019m ignoring that too. Thank you both, for the excellent plan. I really appreciate the assistance.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSure thing doll.\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Jack called me back about ten minutes later. \u201cTwo o\u2019clock, TGITuesdays.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cHi to you too, fucker. It is in fact a goddamn lovely day.\u201d I caught Drake\u2019s eye and rolled my eyes.<br /> <br /> \u201cBull shit. Like you care about small talk. Look, can you come pick me up? Liz\u2019s house boy is creeping me out.\u201d He smirked.<br /> <br /> \u201cOoh, get him to make you a fucking whiskey sour. And/or to make me one. I\u2019ll be there in fifteen or some fucking shit.\u201d<br /> <br /> I got there in ten. Drake held onto the Jesus handles the whole way and took a deep goddamn breath as soon as he got out of the car. He took another when he got a look at the fucking house. I gestured for him to follow and we went inside.<br /> <br /> Jack was lounging around the fucking receiving room. He handed me a whiskey sour when I walked in. \u201cDrake, this generous man is Jack. He works for the Agency took. Jack, Drake.\u201d<br /> <br /> Jack jerked his chin up in a goddamn greeting to Drake, and looked to me. \u201cThe other situation under control?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cDo I need to step away and mill about away from the expensive lamps?\u201d Drake looked between the two of us questioningly.<br /> <br /> \u201cNah, it\u2019s fine.\u201d I waved it on. \u201cIt\u2019s ongoing, but handled.\u201d<br /> <br /> Jack nodded. \u201cGood.\u201d<br /> <br /> Drake looked around at the fucking lavish room. \u201cIs that shaped like...\u201d He stopped and looked at us, \u201cWhose house did you say this was?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWe didn\u2019t.\u201d Jack started moving towards the door. \u201cGabe fill you in any?\u201d<br /> <br /> I shrugged. \u201cSome.\u201d<br /> <br /> The fucker sighed. \u201cCrusher will be there definitely. Probably Rosanna too. She\u2019s apparently some kind of cat-snake.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYou don\u2019t know how appropriate that is.\u201d Drake chuckled.<br /> <br /> \u201cI will be able to see that shit eventually.\u201d Jack set his goddamn jaw.<br /> <br /> \u201cIt\u2019s so weird.\u201d Drake looked over at him. \u201cI dunno if I\u2019m supposed to laugh every time Dirk Dastardly does something.\u201d<br /> <br /> Jack snicked. \u201cFair enough. Anyway - Cliff notes of what I know. The factions of folks like you are named after seasons and called courts. Autumn Court is the most powerful - do not fuck with them, or fucking step on spiders, or they will rape your brain. Rosanna and Crusher are in the Summer Court. Rosanna actually leads it and is exactly as badass as you might think, plus some.\u201d<br /> <br /> Drake let out a goddamn deep breath, standing next to my car. \u201cAlright. They\u2019ll tell me the rest, I guess?\u201d<br /> <br /> I nodded. \u201cNot precisely our playground, that.\u201d<br /> <br /> He shrugged. \u201cI can\u2019t complain too much. I owe you guys one already.\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-21T14:53:31-08:00","id":770971,"title":"","content":"<b>Clytemnestra\u2019s Yarns</b><br /> <br /> <b>Deceptions<br /> </b><br /> \u201cEst\u00fapido!\u201d<br /> <br /> Naomi Cruz shut herself and her friend Deanna Lee in the small room. It held a blue semi-comfortable couch, several chairs of some age, and a large television that cost almost what the rest of the furniture did. Deanna sat, arms crossed, on the couch. Naomi paced.<br /> <br /> \u201cSo besides humiliating me out there, what were you thinking Deanna? Seriously!\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI was thinking,\u201d Deanna\u2019s words were clipped and precise, \u201cThat I was very lonley the past several days when, other than to call me about \u201cmy\u201d case, you have not talked to me. Not made any time for me.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI was busy!\u201d Naomi lifted her arms in a helpless gesture. \u201cI\u2019ve had to get those works to the studio and take care of my work for the agency. I have not had time and you were running around on me.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYou don\u2019t need a job, just get your pretty pretty sugar mama to give you more big bucks,\u201d the words were clipped and pointed.<br /> <br /> Naomi pointed to herself, \u201cMy \u2018pretty pretty sugar mama\u2019 told me to go there, and I keep Lady Covington happy. If she says jump, I jump.\u201d<br /> <br /> Deanna sneered, \u201cGive her three fingers next time she will forgive you and give you some cash.\u201d<br /> <br /> Naomi stopped pacing. She turned and glared at Deanna \u201cYou are calling me a whore, cadala?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI doubt she likes you for your personality.\u201d<br /> <br /> Naomi grabbed Deanna\u2019s shirt and pulled her up face to face. \u201cAnd what you do like me for?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI don\u2019t,\u201d Deanna looked directly in her eyes. \u201cI love you.\u201d<br /> <br /> On a quantom level, the spider twiched.<br /> <br /> Naomi dropped her and took a step back. Deanna caught herself and sat back down, resuming her severe demeanor.<br /> <br /> \u201cDirty pool. Very dirty pool.\u201d Naomi shook her head. Getting rid of the cobwebs, one might say. The spider shifted uncomfortably.<br /> <br /> \u201cIt\u2019s not a gambit. I fucking miss you. I needed help. Two days ago it was Schnapps, last night was Adria that got me through. \u201c<br /> <br /> Ms Weaver the Demon knew Naomi was a persona, but here it was again, love. Naomi was in love. Surely Ms Weaver wasn\u2019t. Still, that\u2019s why Deanna\u2019s betrayal hurt, clearly. Deanna was carefully chosen, a successful student without much social life who would make some time for a girlfriend, but would just assume spend a Saturday night studying. This was supposed to be an easy relationship, especially for a woman who can wrap almost anyone around her finger. She could just use her Exploit to bind Deanna closely like Cassandra, or\u2026<br /> <br /> \u201cLook at Me!\u201d Deanna yelled. Naomi broke from her reverie. Deanna\u2019s eyes were tearing.<br /> <br /> \u201cDeanna,\u201d Despite herself, seeing the pain in the girl\u2019s eyes, Ms Weaver drew on her own personality for a moment. Naomi can have moments of conscience, right? \u201cI\u2019m sorry I hurt you. I was wrapped up in things, and I didn\u2019t really keep up with you as I should have. There was a lot going on, but that is no excuse. Forgive me?\u201d<br /> <br /> Deanna\u2019s jaw dropped. \u201cAre you fucking with me Naomi?\u201d<br /> <br /> Naomi closed her eyes and shook her head, \u201cNo. I am honestly sorry. And I blew up about Adria because I like her too. Not as much as I like you, but I do. We both do, we can admit it. I\u2019d like to talk about it, but not while we are both so upset.\u201d<br /> <br /> Deanna just looked dumbfounded. \u201cBut\u2026okay, okay that\u2019s fine. But are you still going to be like this when we talk again, I mean I don\u2019t want your sass to go away completely but\u2026\u201d<br /> <br /> Naomi, or perhaps more accurately Ms Weaver, touched Deanna on the nose. \u201cI promise. But only for you, amada.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOkay\u201d A weak smile through tears. The spider was moved by its beauty. This is why she was human so much. This was why she could not just add Deanna as a servant. This is why Naomi fell in love. Not her true self, of course.<br /> <br /> \u201cWe need to deal with the immediate, then we can talk. Let me get the keys from Cassandra for Billy Mack, okay?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOkay.\u201d<br /> <br /> Naomi started to leave. Deanna wrapped her arms around herself and muttered \u201cWhat I am I getting myself into?\u201d<br /> <br /> Naomi paused in the doorway, \u201cA relationship, maybe?\u201d<br /> <br /> Deanna spun around, pale, startling the spider. Naomi took a step back, on guard. The spider\u2019s hackles rose. On a quantum level, spinnerets prepared.<br /> <br /> \u201cN-N-Naomi\u2026If that is\u2026really you\u2026when the FUCK did you learn Korean?<br /> <br /> <i>End Session XXX</i><br /> <br /> Drake looks rather canine. I know I was subtle about it, but someone may have caught on <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Quietus\u2019s player arrived a bit late, but nothing major, hence his silence for awhile.<br /> <br /> The Kiss required someone single (not having made a mundane vow or pledge to another person, but relationship status was not otherwise significant) and who had at least one level of Striking Looks. Only Clytemnestra matched.<br /> <br /> \u201cLiz\u201d was on the phone because Vox. Best Embed ever for those with phones and many covers. \u201cThe Web\u201d is the part of Elizabeth\u2019s house that has several lavish bedrooms and can be sealed off with no way of escape (or one can seal oneself inside with the portable control, unless someone outside knows where the other hidden control panel is). Thus Angela would be in luxury with no way to escape.<br /> <br /> Total aide, Shewired rated University of Washington at Seattle one of the best Universities for Queer women. Makes sense given Naomi\u2019s coven I suppose.<br /> <br /> Heather is the Beast who Jack pissed off and Naomi appeased the anger of. Adria has come up a few times, not supernatural as far as anyone knows. Politically Canadian is her weird issue. Adria is not Canadian; she has never even actually been to Canada. She is attractive, cool, charismatic and has \u201cPolitically Canadian\u201d as essentially whatever opinion she agrees with. It\u2019s sort of funny\u2026players kept OOC saying stuff was \u201cNot very Canadian\u201d long after the game ended.<br /> <br /> I think that covers everything. If I missed something your Comments and Questions are welcome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-21T20:32:34-08:00","id":771187,"title":"","content":"Ouch. Sounds like Clytemnestra's Cover is fraying a bit (or most certainly, her cool).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-22T00:51:59-08:00","id":771307,"title":"","content":"Clytemnestra has been through a lot of self-discovery planned from the beginning for her arc. These difficult times have been fun for pushing the character and seeing what she does. So yea, both have freyed a bit (though she passed the Cover check start of the next session and picked up essentially Guilty, which she spent most of next session getting rid of).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-05T02:27:04-08:00","id":780457,"title":"","content":"We return to Seattle and dealing with the crisis at the University. In this episode, Clytemnestra and Kilroy de-escalate it, Speed and Quietus meet some changelings, and Quietus makes a serious error in his judgment.<br /> <br /> Clytemnestra\u2019s journal is, again, a short story that did not occur at table; it takes place with the end of Speed\u2019s journal. However, Speed\u2019s all happened, as always, including dialogue. Enjoy.<br /> <br /> <i>Session XXXI</i><br /> <br /> <b>Speed Demon\u2019s Monologues</b><br /> <br /> We\u2019d just left Liz\u2019s place when her ringtone came from my phone. I glanced at Drake in my rear view mirror and sent it to my bluetooth earpiece. \u201cHey doll. Tell me shit hasn\u2019t fallen to fucking pieces?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cDone,\u201d Liz responded with a slight smile, \u201cat least as far as the Angela/NGN situation is concerned.\u201d There was a pause.<br /> <br /> \u201cBut...?\u201d<br /> <br /> Liz sighed. \u201cI was talking with Deanna and made an error. I... well, I broke character because of how heart hurt she was - Naomi\u2019s natural response would have been bad for her mental health.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cNaomi is a bitch.\u201d I nodded.<br /> <br /> She shrugged. \u201cYes. But in that mindset, when she muttered to herself, I tried to reassure her, but I didn\u2019t notice she was muttering in Korean.\u201d Liz took a deep breath. \u201cShe\u2019s the one that thinks I\u2019m human, that thinks I\u2019m normal. That connection is important.\u201d<br /> <br /> I raised an eyebrow. \u201cI suppose it\u2019s too goddamn late to say \u2018surprise I learned Korean just for you\u2019?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cNaomi doesn\u2019t care enough for that and it\u2019s not quite a momentary lapse to learn Korean. It\u2019s way too far up the timetable for their relationship. Naomi hasn\u2019t even admitted there is a relationship - that will be at least another one and a half months.\u201d I rolled my eyes at the fucking timetable. She continued, \u201cShe\u2019s not going to bolt, or squeal, she just... thinks I\u2019m possessed, or something.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAnd you want your normal relationship back.\u201d I glanced at Jack. \u201cMemories do fade.\u201d<br /> <br /> Liz sounded goddamn resigned. \u201cThere is the memory spike, true. I was hoping to avoid that.\u201d<br /> <br /> I drummed my fingers on the steering wheel. \u201cI don\u2019t see another fucking way around. You could say it was something supernatural, or some shit, and not let on you were supernatural.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAs in, say I cast a spell? That could work.\u201d Liz nodded. \u201cHer trust that I am myself is shaky at the moment though.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cJust be a bitch at her,\u201d I suggested.<br /> <br /> \u201cDeanna does generally appreciate that side of Naomi,\u201d Liz agreed. \u201cI\u2019ll need to say who I learned such things from. Ms Covington is not an option. I don\u2019t want her suspected from this.\u201d<br /> <br /> I ran my fingers through my fucking hair. \u201cIf Miranda was talking to me, I\u2019d see if she\u2019d be willing to be your beard.\u201d<br /> <br /> Liz thought for a goddamn moment. \u201cDeanna has seen - no, she hasn\u2019t. She wasn\u2019t there when Naomi met Miranda, and besides, I think Miranda stopped time or something. Still, that story should work.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cIt handles the Korean. As far as the behaving differently...\u201d I trailed off in thought.<br /> <br /> \u201cIf I can get her trusting me again, I can just say it was a moment of weakness because of how much pain she was in,\u201d Liz said fucking distractedly. \u201cThank you Gabe.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSure thing doll.\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> Kilroy as Angela sat down in a goddamn huff across from Andrew. He looked up at her, one eyebrow raised. \u201cAngela. It is good to see you up and about.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWhat. The. Hell?\u201d Angela stared at him angrily.<br /> <br /> He sighed. \u201cI got a message that you were in trouble. You wouldn\u2019t leave the house, not even for classes. You and the people around you were acting suspiciously. That is my honest answer.\u201d His reply was cold and precise.<br /> <br /> \u201cWho the hell told you to get in my business?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYou did.\u201d He forestalled her exasperated response, holding a goddamn hand up. \u201cI know you said you were fine, but you wouldn\u2019t come out and talk with us. We had no way of knowing you weren\u2019t under duress.\u201d<br /> <br /> Angela sighed and leaned her head back against the fucking wall. \u201cLook, I\u2019m dealing with some things right now.\u201d<br /> <br /> He watched her impassively. \u201cWe were concerned over your safety.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSince when? Since when are you this concerned about me?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSince Cassandra escalated.\u201d He took a bite of pizza. \u201cOriginally, I had thought she was just using the cult to get laid. It was unfortunate that she was using religious bullshit to do it, but... it is a frequent tool used by college students. The message seemed to be an indication that she was tightening her control, in more of the destructive ways a cult can do so.\u201d<br /> <br /> Angela huffed and crossed her arms. \u201cSo I was an excuse?\u201d Kilroy looked him over carefully for leverage points, and found that while he was spooked in general, he was particularly fucking afraid of something happening to the man he loved, Nathan, and was determined to prove Cassandra was dangerous. Interestingly, and probably not unrelatedly, he served as the focal point of a goddamn dampening field for psychic powers and their use enraged him on a metaphysical level.<br /> <br /> With no tonal attempt to reassure, Andrew said, \u201cWe did also believe there was danger to you.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cDid you ever think I might be going through some shit?\u201d A few students paused to turn and look at the woman yelling.<br /> <br /> \u201cYou didn\u2019t say that over the phone.\u201d Andrew raised a goddamn eyebrow.<br /> <br /> \u201cWell, maybe, <u><u>maybe</u></u>, I didn\u2019t want to tell everyone in the world my mom had died.\u201d Angela\u2019s face crumpled. She bit her lip and tried to return to glaring at Andrew without crying.<br /> <br /> Andrew took another bite. \u201cI can understand that.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSo, yeah, I was with people I felt comfortable around and they were helping me deal.\u201d Angela slumped slightly. She seemed lost in unpleasant thought when something occurred to her and she looked up, her brow knit. \u201cWhat did you wait two hours for anyway?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI was not informed until then.\u201d Andrew returned her questioning look levelly.<br /> <br /> Angela sighed. \u201cGreat, there\u2019s another nosy nut job who won\u2019t let me have a mental health break among friends. Who is it?\u201d<br /> <br /> Andrew sat back in his fucking chair. \u201cMy source wishes to remain anonymous. They were very concerned about you.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019ve told you...\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAnd I\u2019ve noted your comments.\u201d Andrew interrupted her.<br /> <br /> Angela stood up, shoving her chair away. \u201cI\u2019m done with this conversation.\u201d<br /> <br /> Andrew looked up at her. \u201cI understand.\u201d<br /> <br /> Angela began walking away, then turned back. \u201cI\u2019m leaving town for a few days. Please don\u2019t call the National Guard on me, kay?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYou have my word, I won\u2019t call the National Guard.\u201d<br /> <br /> Angela rolled her eyes at him. \u201cAnd maybe see a doctor about that stick up your ass.\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> Once Angela was out of the food court, she called Naomi. They exchanged greetings in a goddamn esoteric languages before Naomi hopped right the hell in. \u201cHave you dealt with Andrew?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI have,\u201d Angela responded.<br /> <br /> \u201cYou wouldn\u2019t let me shoot him.\u201d Angela could hear Cassandra\u2019s aggrieved voice from the room on the other end.<br /> <br /> Naomi sighed. \u201cLook, I didn\u2019t mean \u2018dealt with\u2019...\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI let the reason I was holed up slip accidentally.\u201d Angela fucking ignored them. \u201cHe did confirm that someone saved the message for him, but he wouldn\u2019t reveal his source, other than to say they cared about me.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cDr. Cross, you think?\u201d Cassandra spoke up again.<br /> <br /> \u201cPossible, but unlikely I think,\u201d Naomi mused.<br /> <br /> Cassandra shook her head. \u201cOn second thought, no. If Dr Cross sent people after me, she\u2019s more likely to get in trouble herself, since we\u2019re fucking.\u201d<br /> <br /> Angela cleared her throat. \u201cAs a note, Andrew acts as a dampening field for psychic powers and low magics.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI knew it!\u201d Cassandra declared goddamn triumphantly. \u201cMy witchiness has never worked well around him.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cHe is also quite determined to prove that you, Cassandra, are dangerous.\u201d<br /> <br /> There was a pause. \u201cMay I finish him, Master?\u201d<br /> <br /> Naomi sighed. \u201cLet\u2019s not jump to the person he\u2019s trying to expose as a fraud murdering him.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOh, he doesn\u2019t believe she\u2019s a fraud, anymore.\u201d Angela smirked.<br /> <br /> \u201cThis is why you don\u2019t want to be the leader,\u201d Cassandra said, dawning realization in her fucking voice.<br /> <br /> Angela chuckled. \u201cThe only other thing I get might come in handy, if you need leverage - Andrew is particularly concerned with Nathan\u2019s safety as he has the hots for him.\u201d<br /> <br /> Naomi grinned. \u201cEven Cassandra has the hots for Nathan, and she\u2019s a dyke.\u201d<br /> <br /> Cassandra sighed. \u201cI\u2019m not a dyke. I just haven\u2019t had sex with a guy yet.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAnd how many girls have you slept with?\u201d Naomi\u2019s grin turned goddamn wicked.<br /> <br /> \u201cThat doesn\u2019t matter. I am what I say I am.\u201d Cassandra crossed her arms.<br /> <br /> Naomi smirked. \u201cWhatever. Angela, Am\u2019s on the way. Remember, don\u2019t let on anything. She\u2019s a terrible liar. When her parents were visiting, she volunteered right off that she totally hadn\u2019t slept with any girls so they didn\u2019t have to worry about her starting to. It was kinda sad.\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> We got to TGITuesdays first and settled in at a table tucked the hell away in a corner. I\u2019d barely had a chance to eye the all-you-can-eat wilted salad bar when the other Changelings showed up. I caught Crusher\u2019s eye and waved them over. Rosanna\u2019s face crinkled into a fucking snarl when she saw Drake but Crusher\u2019s calming hand in her shoulder kept her from pouncing. She did pace in front of the table before settling down, her goddamn angry eyes fixed on Drake.<br /> <br /> Jack looked up from the menu, a cocky smile on his face. \u201cSo, I was thinking about the tuna burger.\u201d<br /> <br /> Crusher chuckled and sat down next to Rosanna. \u201cI\u2019m not afraid of anything, and that tuna burger terrifies me.\u201d<br /> <br /> Jack nodded to him, still smiling. \u201cCrusher. Rosanna.\u201d He looked at Drake. \u201cWe found a new friend and thought you might be able to lend him a hand.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cGlad to. It\u2019s kinda a duty, plus, we owe you a favor.\u201d Crusher nodded goddamn seriously. Drake met his gaze evenly as the formerly convicted murderer turned to look at the bounty hunter. \u201cSup Drake. Didn\u2019t expect to see you again. Betcha didn\u2019t expect to see me.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cNo. No, not really.\u201d Drake looked between the two Changelings.<br /> <br /> Crusher\u2019s attention was focused on Drake, but he was keeping Rosanna in his fucking line of sight. \u201cThe past is the past, and we\u2019re not here to talk about that. We\u2019re here to talk about you, here in the present.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cBefore we get too far, I do want to mention - you should know White knows about both of you. Enough to use Rosanna to threaten me with.\u201d Drake met both of their eyes, his tone serious.<br /> <br /> \u201cHe knows what he\u2019s talking about then,\u201d Rosanna said with clenched teeth. Crusher put a hand on her shoulder.<br /> <br /> Jack shook his head. \u201cYou don\u2019t wanna be used by White.\u201d<br /> <br /> Rosanna glared at him. \u201cThat doesn\u2019t mean I don\u2019t want to rip his throat out.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWhite is a different deal,\u201d Jack warned.<br /> <br /> \u201cThen I\u2019ll rip out his throat too. It\u2019ll be a party.\u201d Crusher\u2019s hand tightened on her shoulder ever so fucking slightly.<br /> <br /> Conversation died down with the arrival of food, but once the waitress was out of goddamn earshot, Crusher spoke up quickly. \u201cSo, what happened? You said there was a fight?\u201d<br /> <br /> Jack shrugged. \u201cIt was supposed to be a snatch and grab - the clock was ticking and we were on the job, you know? But it turned into a smash and grab. That place over there, the Hedge?\u201d He made half-hearted attempts to gesture to help describe it. \u201cI dunno man, it\u2019s fucked up. But we found a decent ambush site and seized the opportunity.\u201d<br /> <br /> Jack and I managed to spin a decent story while being incredibly fucking vague. Crusher kept the conversation on that until dinner was over when he turned to Drake. \u201cYou still have a place?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI don\u2019t know.\u201d He looked lost. \u201cI just woke up this morning and learned so much time had past...\u201d<br /> <br /> I chuckled. \u201cYou do. Cannon, on account of being such a good goddamn friend of your father, has been handling the bills.\u201d<br /> <br /> That got a fucking smile out of him. Looking back to Crusher he gave a half shrug. \u201cI\u2019m happy to talk there, though I dunno how safe it\u2019ll be.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWe\u2019ll handle it.\u201d Crusher nodded at him and turned to Jack. \u201cI\u2019ve got a good idea what the guy can do. We\u2019ll go to his house and explain. I\u2019m not gonna turn you away but... there won\u2019t be much for ya.\u201d<br /> <br /> Jack nodded his understanding. \u201cThere was that other thing we talked about.\u201d<br /> <br /> Crusher looked confused for a moment. \u201cOh yeah, the deal. You want it to be just you two, or the creepy old white guy too?\u201d<br /> <br /> Jack looked at me and I gave him an uncomprehending shrug. \u201cYeah, him too, if that\u2019s cool.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSure. Give a call when he\u2019s around, we\u2019ll fix you up.\u201d<br /> <br /> As we left, we transferred the fucking body into Crusher\u2019s trunk and Drake into his keeping. I shook his hand and gave him a card. \u201cStay safe.\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> On the way back to Pagan Club\u2019s house, a chill goddamn breeze caught Angela\u2019s attention. Other than the fucking whistling of the wind, campus was still and desolate. Angela looked around quickly, her breath coming fast, and saw no one. \u201cTell me, <u><u>Angela</u></u>, what\u2019s actually going on?\u201d Heather\u2019s voice came from behind her. Angela spun around and saw Heather standing across the small lawn, the epicenter of the cold as hell wind and feelings of goddamn emptiness.<br /> <br /> \u201cThat... that\u2019s kinda freaky there,\u201d Angela stammered, her hands up.<br /> <br /> Heather crossed her arms. \u201cI don\u2019t believe you are actually Angela.\u201d<br /> <br /> Angela\u2019s panic increased. \u201cWho - who would I be, if I\u2019m not me?\u201d<br /> <br /> Heather was closer. \u201cThat\u2019s what I want to know. You\u2019ll tell me eventually. I just have to apply the right...\u201d There was a pause and Heather was in arm\u2019s reach. \u201c...pressure.\u201d<br /> <br /> Kilroy made Angela\u2019s face impassive and controlled her fucking breathing., \u201cIf you hurt me, it will affect Angela.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019m very good with my teeth.\u201d Heather relaxed somewhat as the charade was dropped. \u201cI just want to know what you are. I haven\u2019t seen anything like you - you\u2019re not a spirit, or a ghost.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThat is true.\u201d Kilroy raised a goddamn eyebrow. \u201cWould it help if I said I was trying to help Angela?\u201d<br /> <br /> Heather shrugged. \u201cIt would help you if it was true. I still want to know what\u2019s going on here.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThat makes two of us.\u201d Kilroy looked around, and sighed. \u201cWhat do you know about the Asbury Room?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI know the stories. I\u2019ve avoided it myself.\u201d Heather eyed her fucking suspiciously.<br /> <br /> Kilroy nodded approvingly. \u201cIt\u2019s a bad thing. We\u2019re trying to put a stop to it. Angela is tainted by it.\u201d<br /> <br /> She looked intrigued despite herself. \u201cA spiritual infection then?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAbyssal.\u201d<br /> <br /> Heather frowned. \u201cI don\u2019t know much about that.\u201d She crossed her goddamn arms and leaned against the tree. \u201cNow tell me what you are and you can go.\u201d<br /> <br /> Kilroy\u2019s brow furrowed. \u201cI\u2019ve answered most of the questions here.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYou have.\u201d She looked unimpressed. \u201cAnswer this one and no one gets eaten.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cIf you hurt me, Angela will be damaged, not me,\u201d Kilroy warned.<br /> <br /> Heather smirked. \u201cYou\u2019ve mistaken me for someone who cares.\u201d<br /> <br /> Kilroy raised an eyebrow. \u201cI had.\u201d He paused. \u201cA trade. Who are you?\u201d<br /> <br /> Heather\u2019s eyes flashed. \u201cI am the thing that finds you when you\u2019re by yourself and no one can find you. I am the thing that levels cities and leaves destruction in its wake. I am the thing that reminds you that however much time you spend with your family and friends, eventually you\u2019ll be alone and vulnerable. And when that happens, I\u2019ll be the thing that comes upon you and decides whether or not to eat you. That decides whether I\u2019m hungry today.\u201d She smiled darkly. \u201cI\u2019ve had many names. Tiamat is my current favorite.\u201d<br /> <br /> The possessed girl nodded. \u201cKilroy. I was here.\u201d He looked around. \u201cIt is dangerous to explain w