ok, then continued in Portuguese. \u201cAre we going to take her to the Web or the office?\u201d<br /> <br /> Roxanne smiled slightly, trying for the fucking joke. \u201cIs she speaking lesbian spider?\u201d<br /> <br /> Liz sighed but Vivian preempted her response by asking in Portuguese, \u201cOr the RV?\u201d<br /> <br /> I rolled my eyes and spoke in English. \u201cThe fucking office is more secure.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019m not going to bolt.\u201d She looked at me.<br /> <br /> \u201cCalm down doll. I mean you\u2019ll be more fucking safe, not that it\u2019ll be better at keeping you captive.\u201d I shrugged and took a swig.<br /> <br /> Vivian nodded. \u201cIt would be inhospitable to not address the safety issue. There are two groups of Angels out to capture you.\u201d<br /> <br /> Jack leaned back against the car. \u201cWith that in mind, mind telling us what powers you have? You can tell me to fuck off, if you want.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI would prefer not to say.\u201d She looked around nervously.<br /> <br /> \u201cThat\u2019s the most polite \u2018fuck off\u2019 I\u2019ve ever fucking heard.\u201d I winked at her.<br /> <br /> Vivian smiled. \u201cThey certainly impressed Shooter.\u201d Roxanne relaxed a little, enough to give a smug chuckle.<br /> <br /> I spun my keys around my finger. \u201cWe ready to get the hell out of here?\u201d<br /> <br /> Kayla shook her own keys. \u201cI can drive back.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYou\u2019ll get shot at again.\u201d Liz webbed the keys.<br /> <br /> \u201cI can drive! We\u2019ll put her in the other car.\u201d Kayla tugged on the goddamn keys.<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019ll web you next!\u201d<br /> <br /> Kayla smirked. \u201cThis doesn\u2019t seem the time or the place.\u201d<br /> <br /> Liz stared at her. \u201cAre you trying to tempt me into webbing you? Cause I will.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI know.\u201d Kayla stepped in close, with the hand holding the keys held out behind her, keeping the webbing fucking taut.<br /> <br /> I turned to Roxanne. \u201cWhy don\u2019t you hop in this one?\u201d<br /> <br /> Roxanne was watching Liz and Kayla, fascinated. \u201cThey do seem... distracted.\u201d<br /> <br /> Kayla won the argument and those two slid into the Maserati. Before the door shut, we could hear Kayla ask, \u201cAm I going to get eaten?\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> We drove for awhile in the Underworld, to make sure we came back in a different goddamn place than we\u2019d hopped in. As we got back out, Jack turned to Roxanne. \u201cSo about those things you asked for...\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cLook, I asked for the whole harem thing, because I was just webbed by a pair of lesbian - it was weird. I feel better now.\u201d She smiled at him. \u201cI would like something that\u2019s not spicy pizza.\u201d<br /> <br /> Liz\u2019s voice came over the Bluetooth. \u201cPansexual! I don\u2019t like being limited...\u201d<br /> <br /> Vivian\u2019s eyes widened and their color came back as she blinked a few times. \u201cThe jamming will not be useful, and we will not be returning anywhere. She has clairvoyance.\u201d<br /> <br /> Jack slammed his fist into the door. \u201cShit.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cFuck.\u201d I gunned the engines, and drove past the office.<br /> <br /> <i>End Session XXXVI</i><br /> <br /> Kayla took all Lethal through her health levels, but managed to stay conscious. Was a legit roll for her, though.<br /> <br /> So it is time to get the hell out of dodge. For a month or so anyway, lest Kim be particularly dangerous.<br /> <br /> In good news, we have added a player, and are technically full. His first appearance will be this upcoming session. More on this later.<br /> <br /> Kim having Clairvoyance on the heroes is a problem. So they may need to skip town for awhile. Fine with me, move the timeline ahead.<br /> <br /> Okay, lot to cover. Comments and questions welcome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02