piracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-13T14:39:18-08:00","id":829418,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baroness Nerak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play?p=829348#post829348\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No. He is not currently in the area. There is going to be a going to ground early in tonight's game in other cities, and one of the PCs (leaning toward Jack atm) will be meeting him. He is looking at a Psychopomp Integrator with detective trope McGyver (as opposed to Gumshoe, Government Man, Femme Fatale, Blacksploitation Hero, and Boy Detective), but we will see how things end up.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Huh. If going for the McGyver angle, Analyst might work better (if it is allowed, that is).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T01:09:30-08:00","id":829611,"title":"","content":"Analyst is allowed, but I told him he would need to be very familiar with the setting to play them. He went Psychopomp because of their buildy aspects.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T14:55:31-08:00","id":839447,"title":"","content":"I am back from Vacation! And clearing my backlog of journals that need to go up. Step one is Demon. No Clytemnestra, Kilroy instead. Also, meet Terry.<br /> <br /> <i>Session XXXVII</i><br /> <br /> <b>Speed Demon\u2019s Monologues</b><br /> <br /> I dropped the others off at scattered places after they arranged for pickups - Liz called Kayla and Vivian Casey. Steele went with Vivian. The hacker promised to have her seen in Vegas before they fucked off to Tijuana and then off the continent. It was the best excuse I could think of to have us out of town for a month - a bounty that goddamn big could mean at least a few months of the high life for the private dick who brought her in. Vegas was as good of a fucking place to start the trail as any.<br /> <br /> Once I\u2019d dropped them off, I called Miranda. \u201cHey beautiful. There\u2019s been something of a change of plans.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOh?\u201d She sounded serious, concerned. \u201cIs something wrong?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThings have gone a little belly up.\u201d I tapped my fingers on the fucking steering wheel. \u201cOne of the fuckers we rescued Steele from has clairvoyance - we can\u2019t go home for at least a month. And uh...\u201d I bit my lip. \u201cWell, if you came with me, she\u2019ll see you.\u201d<br /> <br /> There was a pause. \u201cAnd that would make me a target. A weak spot.\u201d<br /> <br /> I chuckled. \u201cNothing about you is weak, sweetheart. It\u2019s your call - I want a month long vacation with my beautiful dame more than anything, but I wasn\u2019t about to put you in danger without you knowing about it.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cLike I put you in danger from the Seers?\u201d I started to object but she kept going. \u201cYour enemies are mine. That\u2019s the way this works, right?\u201d I chuckled again. She took it for a yes. \u201cSo, where are we going? Is the whole agency coming along?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cNah, we\u2019re scattering. I wasn\u2019t sure where - Ireland sound alright?\u201d I scanned the streets for familiar cars, taking turns at random.<br /> <br /> She smiled. \u201cThat is a good place for whiskey. If it wasn\u2019t a romantic getaway, then I\u2019d say we should clock Kayla over the head and bring her with. Liz might not appreciate that though.\u201d She thought for a moment. \u201cIreland would be good. I have an academic interest in Magh Slecht - it was the center of the cult of Crom Cruach, who is a fascinating figure.\u201d<br /> <br /> I smiled. \u201cSold! Whiskey and academics for all. Why don\u2019t you go ahead and book us some tickets where she won\u2019t have a chance to see, leaving from somewhere not here and get Cecilia to drop you off at the closest library.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cUnderstood, Gabe. I\u2019ll see you soon.\u201d She stood carefully.<br /> <br /> \u201cNot soon enough for me, love.\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> I got the text a bit later and stopped circling two blocks over to make my way to the library. I drummed the steering wheel as I parked, glancing around quickly as she got in the car. As soon as she was buckled in and told me the tickets were out of Bellingham, I gunned it the hell out of the city, heading east initially.<br /> <br /> Once we were in more open country, I relaxed a little. Then I remembered the goddamn conversation I needed to have before we got on a plane together and tensed up again. Miranda noticed, and looked around. \u201cSomething else wrong?\u201d<br /> <br /> I let out a sigh. \u201cNo, just... I need to tell you something, before we leave.\u201d I ran my hand up to the top of the steering wheel and pulled, stretching. Stalling. \u201cYou know how Jimmy was talking about the group at the hotel, and I said we had it under control?\u201d She nodded. \u201cThey\u2019re part of a God Machine cult, an attempt to make super stigmatics, according to Roxanne. Well, the second bit is according to her. We know it\u2019s a God Machine cult and in phase two of their big project because of what I found.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOK...\u201d Miranda raised an eyebrow.<br /> <br /> \u201cI found it by...\u201d I brushed my hair back. \u201c...by sleeping with one of the higher ups in it.\u201d<br /> <br /> There was a long pause. It got long enough I risked a glance at her. Her brow was furrowed but other than that her face was blank. She looked away. \u201cThis was since we were together, I presume?\u201d I nodded. She took in a shuddering breath. \u201cWhat does she mean to you?\u201d<br /> <br /> I shook my head. \u201cNothing. She\u2019s someone with information that helps me keep me and mine safe.\u201d I looke