 a harder target than she was.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI still don't know what you are talking about.\u201d He turned the hell away from her.<br /> <br /> \u201cYou are in mortal danger if I see you again,\u201d she threatened, fucking calmly.<br /> <br /> The man took a drink. \u201cThen you won\u2019t see me.\u201d<br /> <br /> It wasn\u2019t quite the impression I\u2019d gotten from her description, but it was a goddamn interesting interaction. Her wording seemed off, but I didn\u2019t have anything to put my fucking finger on. Yet.<br /> <br /> Pretty promises be damned, but after that I looked into her business. She sold pills, apparently, experimental, non-FDA approved medication out of Europe. Not the worst fucking thing an unknown supernatural might get up to at Kiki\u2019s on a regular basis, but at least I could appreciate her wanting to keep our noses clean. Felonies are not my favorite \u2018nice to meet you\u2019 present.<br /> <br /> The only thing I could think of after that was looking into why the hell a Native American looking dame talked with a goddamn eastern European accent. So I went looking for \u2018home\u2019.<br /> <br /> I got a memory of 8 year old Nikka standing in front of a house on a reservation, probably in South Dakota. I was able to get a house number and a street name from a nearby sign. She, her sister and her white father were fucking splattered in blood. The man had the worst of it - from the looks of it, he had used the shotgun on his back at point blank range. He knelt in front of the two girls, pointing at the house and speaking in Croatian. \u201cLook at that house. Remember you never want to come back here. Your mother\u2019s killer are dead; there is nothing for us. We can only go up from here - there is nowhere down to go.\u201d Little Nikka didn\u2019t look convinced. She kept looking sadly back at the house as her father led her the hell away.<br /> <br /> Cecilia poked her head in the door. \u201cSee. She\u2019s hot!\u201d<br /> <br /> I shook my head, blinking fucking quickly and shifting back. \u201cJesus fuck.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAre you OK?\u201d Cecilia looked concerned.<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019m fine.\u201d I brushed my hair out of my eyes and walked over to the stairway, calling up it. \u201cWhen you fucks are done, get the hell down here.\u201d<br /> <br /> Billy Mack, Terry and Jack wandered into the conference room eventually. The g-man raised an eyebrow at me as I downed a shot. \u201cEverything alright?\u201d<br /> <br /> I gave him a big smile. \u201cWe have a new client. I\u2019m gonna go in chronological order here. For starters, a family bonding moment at age 8.\u201d I explained the job and all the shit I'd learned, leaving out the part where she thought I was cute.<br /> <br /> \u201cSo her sister\u2019s missing, but that\u2019s not what she\u2019s hiring us for?\u201d Jack leaned back in his seat.<br /> <br /> \u201cNah. If we find her, we get a fucking bonus though - probably in crisp, non-sequential bills.\u201d I smirked.<br /> <br /> Jack frowned, suspicion written on his goddamn face. \u201cAnd who was she selling pills to?\u201d<br /> <br /> I raised an eyebrow. \u201cI hate to fucking belabor a point but... probably someone who can pay in crisp, non-sequential C-notes.\u201d<br /> <br /> Cecilia sighed. \u201cI wonder if she wants a teaching job.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWe need to know more,\u201d Billy Mack warned.<br /> <br /> \u201cDo you think she\u2019s one of the Christian God\u2019s Angels?\u201d Cecilia frowned.<br /> <br /> He shook his head. \u201cNo, but there are many other issues.\u201d<br /> <br /> She nodded her head, goddamn serious. \u201cAnd we must protect Mistress\u2019 school. Girls might come from as far away as California. Her influence will grow and her web expand.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cRight.\u201d I raised an eyebrow at her. \u201cIf we\u2019re all in, I\u2019ll call Liz, let her know where we\u2019ll be.\u201d The others nodded, so I went back to the office to call Naomi. \u201cHey. We got a new client. I\u2019ll fill you in later, but it involved following a potentially bad man from Kiki\u2019s.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSounds exciting. I think I could round up a few friends for a night out. That way I\u2019d be nearby.\u201d The pink haired girl fucking giggled, pushing someone away.<br /> <br /> I rolled my eyes. \u201cWhatever you like, doll. Seven\u2019s when the client shows up - we\u2019ll be fucking set up by then. Careful who the hell you bring. The client\u2019s supernatural and the mug probably is too.\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> Billy Mack made his own phone call. When Shelley answered the phone, he swapped to Vivian\u2019s voice. \u201cHey Shelley. I, uh, I know it\u2019s been a few weeks. But I said I would explain things when I got back in town and I\u2019m back.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSo, you wanna talk?\u201d Shelley sounded fucking noncommittal.<br /> <br /> \u201cWhen is good for you?\u201d Billy Mack put a goddamn hopeful note in Vivian\u2019s voice.<br /> <br /> She thought for a moment. \u201cI\u2019m working tonight. Maybe tomorrow, we could do lunch.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cLunch sounds good. TGITuesdays?\u201d<br /> <br /> Shelley nodded. \u201cSure.\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> I took the time until evening researching likely candidates for a failed acting career. It wasn\u2019t precisely my goddamn specialty, the local arts scene, and it took longer than I figured to find some theatrical fuck up. After an hour or so, I did find a goddamn winner. Some chucklefuck decided \u2018it had been long enough\u2019 and written a play called \u201cBTW, I Have AIDS\u201d. I didn\u2019t have to look at the reviews - no actor that was even halfway decent would have taken a role in that play.<br /> <br /> I did anyway - call it morbid goddamn curiosity - and Jesus fucking Christ, but the male second lead was absolute shit at whatever the hell skill it takes to flap your gums on stage, according to every one I read. He did plenty of flapping them off stage too, though he\u2019d gone awful quiet after the last few days. I took down a name and did some preliminary digging into where I could find him. Always nice to have a side project.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Kilroy\u2019s Transmissions</b><br /> <br /> My Dearest Ganora,<br /> <br /> I am afraid we've been tagged by an angel. The Night Train is going to be away from the area until the effect expires to prevent the surveillance from compromising any of the agency's assets.<br /> <br /> Only my Vivian cover has been seen so far and it is my intention to restrict myself to that one to avoid compromising the others. Fortunately, there is nothing to connect her to Diablo so your security should be unaffected.<br /> <br /> While I can and will still be at your side in an instant if need be, this would carry quite misfortunate consequences for our people until this surveillance runs its course so it should be avoided in all but the most dire of circumstances. I would hate for my presence to endanger what we have built together or the very promising future our people have ahead of them. Our day will come my beautiful queen, but for now we must bide our time and be patient.<br /> <br /> It should only require a month for this surveillance to expire but it shall none the less be quite vexing to spend so long deprived of your glorious presence. I shall be counting the hours until I can once again take you into my arms. Until then, stay strong and stay safe.<br /> <br /> Kilroy<br /> <br /> <br /> <b><u>To: Scarecrow<br /> From: Kilroy<br /> October 15th</u></b><br /> <br /> Situation in Seattle area has become untenable. All members of the Night Train will be unavailable until the 14th of November.<br /> <br /> Subject &lt;Kim&gt; is confirmed to be an angel. Specifics indicate a high rank terminator build. Intelligence gathered from individuals dealing with her indicate personality traits typical to such configuration: humorless, driven, relentless, merciless.<br /> <br /> Confirmed abilities: Able to draw physical objects into Twilight state. Quicksilver movement. Blast. Clairvoyance.<br /> <br /> Latter ability is the reason for Night Train's withdrawal from region and disbursal. Physical contact with myself and my agency should be avoided until clairvoyant link has expired.<br /> <br /> Unclear if &lt;Kim&gt; is exiled but behavior and disposition seem characteristic of normal operating perimeters. My best guess is that the subject is uncompromised but subject to Micheal White's authority. Likelihood of falling seems very low but possible conflict of command hierarchy might be leverageable if discord between White and the God-Machine escalates.<br /> <br /> Thumb drives and all physical files collected by Roxanne Steele have been secured by &lt;Kim&gt; and are in the possession of White. Thumb drives contain details and blueprints for an extensive storage, reclamation, repair, and construction facility for angels. Facility is cause for increased power generation Infrastructure such as the Diablo Dam and Water Wheel. Also likely the reason behind the Water Wheel's unconventional pain-based Essence gathering elements. I theorize that &lt;Puriel&gt; may be connected to this new Infrastructure, it would explain the level of leeway granted and concerns stemming from the fate of the Works would explain her excessive behavior.<br /> <br /> Recent activities by Blue Sun are unrelated to this Infrastructure. Blue Sun is a stigmatic enhancement project. Limited data available indicates Blue Sun has successfully boosted the abilities of its test subjects and is currently attempting to overcome resulting negative physical side effects. Current efforts appear to be focused on using implants to regulate the increased power levels and have prolonged the lifespan of the enhanced stigmatics.<br /> <br /> The Night Train should be returning to the Seattle area and the good fight in a month's time.<br /> <br /> <b><u>End Message</u></b><br /> <br /> <br /> To: Shelly Waters<br /> From: Vivian Marley<br /> Date: 10-18-2014<br /> <br /> First off, let me say that I am very sorry about this darling. This is not the way I wanted to deal with this but the universe decided to blindside me and I'm scrambling.<br /> <br /> The situation is too complicated to go into here and it is too dangerous to see you right now. I have to leave town and lay low to avoid the authorities for a while. But I promise I'll contact you when it's safe again and explain everything.<br /> <br /> In the mean time, if anyone comes to you looking for me, don't try to protect me. Answer their questions truthfully and tell them what they want to know. Please, trust me when I say these people are dangerous. Nothing you know is more important than your safety to me.<br /> <br /> Stay safe and don't worry about me. This isn't my first rodeo, I know what I'm doing.<br /> <br /> Love,<br /> Vivian<br /> <br /> <br /> To: Casey Rogers<br /> From: Marley's Ghost<br /> Date: 10-23-2014<br /> <br /> Sorry about that bit of excitement there at the dorm but I must say, you handled yourself quite well. I knew from the first time I laid eyes on you that you were a clever boy. I do hope the bus ride back from Vegas wasn't too uncomfortable and you've gotten settled into a new room without too much trouble.<br /> <br /> Don't forget to take those books to that clearing I showed you in the woods tonight. I really don't want to have to deal with that talking owl's hobgoblin leg breakers when I get back to town. Also, it would be bad for my reputation to not live up to my end of a deal. I just hope at least one of those books is what he wants. Either way, don't worry, you should be fine. In fact, as I understand the way faire magic works, you won't even see anything out of the ordinary.<br /> <br /> V<br /> <br /> PS: Enjoy the attached pictures. Sailor Moon isn't usually my thing but you earned a treat for being such a good boy. Now don't let me down tonight and I'll wear that outfit for you once I'm back in town.<br /> <br /> <br /> To: Shelly Waters<br /> From: Vivian Marley<br /> Date: 11-3-2014<br /> <br /> Just wanted to let you know that I am safe. Better for you if you don't know where but I've gone to ground with some people that I can trust and it looks like this mess is going to blow over before too much longer.<br /> <br /> I miss you.<br /> <br /> Love,<br /> Vivian<br /> <br /> <br /> <b><u>MSG to Roxanne Steele 11-15-2014</u></b><br /> <br /> Hey there Roxy. I know I should use your new name but this line is as secure as it gets. I must say, the drive back from Tijuana wasn't half as much fun without the company, even if I wasn't watching over my shoulder for hunter-killers the whole way. I skipped Vegas on the way back and have reunited with the Night Train successfully. The others all seem to have weathered the storm without mishap.<br /> <br /> I hope all continues to go according to plan for you there. You've got a solid foundation in place and I have no doubt you'll be running Sofia (if not all of Bulgaria) in no time. Still if you do need my assistance with anything, you know I am just a phone call away.<br /> <br /> Sorry again about the scar, but not even the most upscale veterinarians have the ideal tools for neurosurgery. I'm confident that everything went smoothly, any residual symptoms from nerve damage should have manifested by now but you may want to keep doing a self check on fingertip and toe sensation and if you experience any of the items I went over with you contact me or a doctor you can trust.<br /> <br /> Well, it does seems there is indeed no rest for the wicked. Things did not politely wait for us while we were laying low so I need to see what caught fire while I wasn't here and start putting it out. I'll stay in touch.<br /> <br /> Viv<br /> <br /> PS: Tell Yuri and Vlad I miss their magic fingers already. And if you should ever decide that you don't need both of Eastern Europe's best masseuses I promise I'll give one of them a good home. You know, as a favor to you since I'm such a good a friend and all.<br /> <br /> <i>End Session XXXVII</i><br /> <br /> Oh man<br /> <br /> Terry is an Integrator and Psychopomp. Which means in total counting Fulgur who may hopefully show again we have 2 Destroyers, 2 Psychopomps, 1 Messenger 1 Guardian, and means we are now full unless someone (formally) drops. There will be a lot more on Terry coming up. He was designed about a week before the session he showed up in, and had a pic but no background. I will hopefully be getting more info soon, and updating the main page. Short version is he is a buildy mechanic character, with his investigaror stereotype being \u201cMcGuyver\u201d to go with Speed\u2019s \u201cGumshoe,\u201d Kilroy\u2019s \u201cGovernment Agent/Hacker,\u201d Quietus\u2019s \u201cShaft,\u201d Clytemnestra\u2019s \u201cFemme Fatale,\u201d and Fulgur\u2019s \u201c(Grown Up) Boy Detective.\u201d<br /> <br /> Liz and Naomi appears at the virtually the same time due to use of Alibi. The voice changes as always are due to Vox, which both Clytemnestra and Kilroy now have.<br /> <br /> And what is our Nikka\u2019s story? I MAY have chosen a lot of aspects of her to deliberately push Speed\u2019s player\u2019s buttons. If I get a background, it will be upcoming.<br /> <br /> There was no game Saturday as I was out of town. In about 2 weeks I will be putting up current, up to date versions of the stats of anyone who keeps a digital record, which I think will be just Clytemnestra and Kilroy, but we will see. Comments and Questions welcome.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-11T21:52:51-08:00","id":845950,"title":"","content":"Two weeks ago I was on the west coast and so there was no Demon game. In lieu of a set of journals this time, then, I have the stats for about half of the Agency as of the last session. Enjoy.<br /> <br /> <b>Speed Demon (Gabe Norton), Inquisitor Psychopomp Demon</b><br /> <br /> Name: Speed Demon, Gabe Norton<br /> Agenda: Inquisitor<br /> Incarnation: Psychopomp<br /> Virtue/Vice: Stubborn/Addictive Personality<br /> <br /> Aspirations:<br /> Long term:<br /> Why the hell did it want despair anyway?<br /> Short term:<br /> Goddamn mustard gas breathing motherfuckers<br /> <br /> <br /> Attributes:<br /> Mental:<br /> Intelligence 3<br /> Wits 4<br /> Resolve 4<br /> <br /> Physical:<br /> Strength 2<br /> Dex 3 <br /> Stamina 2<br /> <br /> Social:<br /> Presence 2<br /> Manipulation 2<br /> Composure 3<br /> <br /> Skills:<br /> Mental:<br /> Academics 2 (Law, Movies)<br /> Computer 0<br /> Crafts 2 (Mechanic)<br /> Investigation 5<br /> Medicine 1<br /> Occult 1 (God Machine)<br /> Politics 1<br /> Science 0<br /> <br /> Physical:<br /> Athletics 1<br /> Brawl 1<br /> Drive 4 (Tailing)<br /> Firearms 2<br /> Larceny 3 (Hot wiring)<br /> Stealth 4<br /> Survival 0<br /> Weaponry 0<br /> <br /> Social:<br /> Animal Ken 0<br /> Empathy 3<br /> Expression 1<br /> Intimidation 3<br /> Persuasion 1 (Mind reading)<br /> Socialize 1<br /> Streetwise 1<br /> Subterfuge 2<br /> <br /> Covers:<br /> Gabe Norton 8<br /> Glen Erikson 2<br /> <br /> Primum 6<br /> <br /> Merits: <br /> High Performance Driving 4<br /> Trained Observer 3<br /> Allies: Local Police 1<br /> Bolthole 3 (Easy Access)<br /> <br /> Derived Stats:<br /> Willpower (Res + Comp): 7<br /> Initiative (Dex + Comp): 6<br /> Health (Stamina + Size): 7<br /> Defense (min(Dex,Wits) + Athletics): 4<br /> Speed (Str + Dex + 5): 10<br /> <br /> Demon form:<br /> Modifications:<br /> Sense the Angelic<br /> Rivet Arm<br /> Radio Suite<br /> Mental Resistance<br /> Technologies:<br /> Aura Sight<br /> Mind Reading<br /> Mirrored Skin<br /> Laser Cutter<br /> Propulsions:<br /> Treads<br /> Processes:<br /> Amorphous<br /> <br /> Embeds:<br /> Soup Up<br /> You Can Tell Me<br /> Lost in the Crowd<br /> Open Sesame<br /> Like the Movies<br /> Check Backdrop<br /> Alibi<br /> Vox<br /> <br /> Exploits:<br /> Demon Car<br /> <br /> Interlock:<br /> Double Indemnity<br /> The Woman in the Window<br /> The Third Man<br /> <br /> Glitches:<br /> Can't stop moving (P)<br /> Wrinkled clothes (P)<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Kilroy (William McKenzie, Vivian Marley), Inquisitor/Saboteur Guardian Demon</b><br /> <br /> Name: Kilroy<br /> Covers: William \u201cBilly Mac\u201d McKenzie<br /> Vivian Marley<br /> <br /> <i>Knowledge is power. The Truth shall set you free.</i><br /> <br /> Incarnation: Guardian<br /> Agenda: Inquisitor/Saboteur<br /> <br /> Virtue: Curious<br /> Vice: Callous<br /> Aspirations: Bring down the Tower (long term)<br /> Use the thumb drive on Team Tomorrow (short term)<br /> Repair relationship with Shelly (short term)<br /> <br /> Int 4 Str 2 Pre 2<br /> Wit 4 Dex 2 Man 4 <br /> Res 2 Sta 2 Com 4<br /> <br /> Academics 2 (Research)<br /> Computer 4* (Hacking)<br /> Crafts 1 <br /> Investigate 2 <br /> Medicine 2 <br /> Occult 1 <br /> Politics 1<br /> Science 3* (Demolitions)(Analysis)<br /> <br /> Athletics 2 <br /> Brawl <br /> Drive <br /> Firearms 2 <br /> Larceny <br /> Stealth <br /> Survival <br /> Weapon <br /> <br /> Animal Ken - <br /> Empathy 1 <br /> Expression - <br /> Intimidate 1 <br /> Persuasion 2 (Negotiation)<br /> Socialize 1 <br /> Streetwise 2* (Black Market)<br /> Subterfuge 2 <br /> <br /> Merits (common):<br /> Area of Expertise (Hacking)<br /> Good Time Management<br /> Patient<br /> Professional Training (Hacker) 5<br /> Resources 2<br /> Multiple Agenda<br /> Electromagnetic Linguistics<br /> Terrible Form 4<br /> Advanced Form<br /> Resonance Sensitive<br /> Retainer 2 (Casey Rogers)<br /> <br /> Merits (William McKenzie):<br /> Contacts (FBI)<br /> <br /> Merits (Vivian Marley):<br /> Status 2 (Hacker Community) <br /> Contacts (Conspiracy Fringe, Cybercriminals)<br /> <br /> <br /> Primum 4<br /> Willpower 5<br /> Cover 7 (William McKenzie)<br /> Cover 4 (Vivian Marley)<br /> Health 7<br /> Aether 13/4<br /> Size 5<br /> Defense 4<br /> Initiative 4<br /> Speed 9<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Embeds: Anarchism, Cause and Effect, Download Knowledge, Momentum, Sum of All Fears, On The Mend, Sabotage, Data Wipe, Identity Theft. Password Entropy, Vox, The Map is Not The Territory, Meaningless<br /> <br /> Exploits: Possession, Break to Heal<br /> <br /> Cypher: Someone Set Us Up The Bomb, For Great Justice, All Your Base are Belong to Us<br /> <br /> Demon Form:<br /> Mods: Armored Plates, Component Indicators, Inhuman Intelligence, Night Vision, Rivet Arm<br /> <br /> Techs: Clairvoyant Sight, Shielded Compartment, Mirrorskin<br /> <br /> Propulsion: Aquatic, Phasing<br /> <br /> Process: Aegis Protocol, Dataform, Memory Theft<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Clytemnestra (Elizabeth Covington, Naomi Cruz), Tempter Messenger Demon</b><br /> <br /> Clytemnestra/Ms Weaver/Elizabeth \u201cLiz\u201d Covington/Naomi Cruz<br /> Demon<br /> Concept: Femme Fatale<br /> Aspirations: Make a Relationship with Kayla Work (Long Term), Build a University Cult, Seduce the Redheaded Angel (short term)<br /> Virtue: Patience <br /> Vice: Decadence<br /> Incarnation: Messenger<br /> Agenda: Tempter<br /> Place of Arrival: Olympia, Washington, USA<br /> <br /> Intelligence: 2<br /> Wits: 4<br /> Resolve: 3<br /> <br /> Strength: 2<br /> Dexterity: 4<br /> Stamina: 2<br /> <br /> Presence: 3<br /> Manipulation: 5<br /> Composure: 3<br /> <br /> Academics: 1<br /> Computer: 1<br /> Crafts: 1<br /> Investigation: 1<br /> Medicine: 1<br /> Occult: 1<br /> Politics: 2 [Asset]<br /> Science: 0<br /> <br /> Athletics: 2 (Climbing)<br /> Brawl: 2 (Grappling)<br /> Drive: 0<br /> Firearms: 0<br /> Larceny: 1<br /> Stealth: 1<br /> Survival: 0<br /> Weaponry: 0<br /> <br /> Animal Ken: 0<br /> Empathy: 3<br /> Expression: 3<br /> Intimidation: 1<br /> Persuasion: 4 (Seduction, Vice) [Asset]<br /> Socialize: 4 (Clubs, Dancing) [Asset]<br /> Streetwise: 1 (Drugs)<br /> Subterfuge: 1<br /> <br /> Across a Crowded Room, Alibi, Ambush, Heart's Desire, Idle Conversation, Quick Change, Read Hostility, Shift Consequence, Social Dynamics, Vox, Wave Function Collapse<br /> <br /> Addictive Presence, Halo, Raise Dead<br /> <br /> Kiss of Death<br /> Welcome to My Parlor<br /> What A Tangled Web<br /> <br /> Demon Form:<br /> Modifications: Claws and Fangs, Low Density, Night Vision, Olfactory Enhancers, Sonic Acuity<br /> Technologies: Acid Spit, Adhesive, Essence Drain, Inhuman Beauty<br /> Propulsion: Long Limbs, Tether<br /> Processes: Extra Mechanical Limbs, Insect Swarm<br /> <br /> Primum: 6<br /> Willpower: 6<br /> Cover: 7 (Liz)<br /> Cover: 5 (Naomi)<br /> Health: 7<br /> Aether: 15<br /> Size: 5<br /> Defense: 6/9<br /> Initiative: 6<br /> Speed 11/16<br /> <br /> Contacts: (Socialite) 2<br /> Cult 4<br /> Cult 1<br /> Resources 4<br /> Pusher<br /> Striking Looks 2 (4)<br /> Style: Terrifying Form 4<br /> Suborned Infrastructure 3<br /> Professional: Socialite 5<br /> <br /> Cipher<br /> <br /> Key 1: Heart's Desire<br /> <br /> Key 2: Ambush<br /> <br /> Interlock: Kiss of Death<br /> <br /> The allure of the black widow is powerful and deadly, often causing her prey to watch in helpless fascination as she closes in for the kill.<br /> <br /> This Interlock effects a single target, which must be able to see Clytemnestra. If the target of this power is engaged in active combat Clytemnestra's roll is at -3.<br /> <br /> Dice Pool: Presence + Intimidation \u2013 Composure + Power Stat<br /> <br /> Cost: 1 Aether<br /> <br /> Dramatic Failure: The target's fear of Clytemnestra causes them to defend more vigorously. Their defense against Clytemnestra's attacks is +3 until the end of the scene and she cannot use this power against them again.<br /> <br /> Failure: The target is able to defend normally.<br /> <br /> Success: Target loses their defense against Clytemnestra's next attack as per a successful surprise attack.<br /> <br /> Exceptional Success: Clytemnestra's next attack against the target is a killing blow<br /> <br /> Key 3: Read Hostility<br /> <br /> Interlock: Welcome to my Parlor<br /> <br /> A spider has an instinctive awareness of webs even those she did not make herself. Clytemnestra can sense traps and alarms within her field of vision.<br /> <br /> Dice Pool: Wits + Larceny<br /> <br /> Dramatic Failure: Clytemnestra receives one or more false readings from safe places/items.<br /> <br /> Failure: Clytemnestra detects nothing<br /> <br /> Success: Clytemnestra becomes aware of all physical triggers (tripwires, pressure plates, motion sensors and the like) within her field of vision. Most can be avoided freely, and any rolls to pass without setting one off they are made with a bonus equal to her Primum<br /> <br /> Exceptional Success: As above. In addition, Clytemnestra can sense and avoid magical traps and alarms in the area as well.<br /> <br /> Key 4: Social Dynamics<br /> <br /> Interlock: What a Tangled Web<br /> <br /> Any demon with Social Dynamics can see the web of connections between the members of a group, but with this interlock Clytemnestra can weave and change those threads to suit her needs. She can modify the thread between any two individuals in her presence. This power works within the same perimeters as Social Dynamics, an executive will still be her secretary's boss but this power could make them view each other as equal partners and friends (or any other possible work relationship).<br /> <br /> This power can add threads that did not previously exist, temporarily adding someone to a social web though it does not edit memories so there is a potential risk of compromise if the change is too extreme.<br /> <br /> The changes wrought by this power are only as permanent as most social interactions. The altered threads will always hold for at least a scene and then in most cases will begin to drift back to normal based on the individuals in question. Depending on the people involved and their reactions to the experience the changes may last longer or lead to lingering alterations in the dynamic. <br /> <br /> Dice Pool: Presence + Socialize<br /> <br /> Dramatic Failure: Clytemnestra losses sight of the social webs entirely. Any changes made previously remain in effect but she loses any bonuses to social rolls from Social Dynamics and cannot attempt to use What A Tangled Web on this group again for the rest of the scene.<br /> <br /> Failure: Clytemnestra is unable to pluck the thread properly. She may roll again at a cumulative penalty of -1 per attempt beyond the first.<br /> <br /> Success: Clytemnestra's power alters the social connection as Clytemnestra wishes. While some long term effects are possible depending on what behavior the new dynamic brought to the surface established relationships will tend to normalize after the effect is over.<br /> <br /> Exceptional Success: Clytemnestra may alter a number threads equal to her Primum at once with this activation of the power.<br /> <br /> Quote: \u201c<i>Oh Darling, you look good enough to eat!</i>\u201d<br /> <br /> --<br /> <br /> Interesting bunch. I need to put the so far completed Ciphers us. The three here (and Quietus) have, but we have not gotten far on Terry or Fulgur. Back to usual next time. See you then. Comments and Questions Welcome.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-19T01:57:26-07:00","id":849650,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s the off week for Night Train, and I am adding the next, and probably last, PC to the list. This information is also on the front page. Note also the character stat profiles above if curious about the agency.<br /> <br /> <b>Markizel \u201cTerry McTavert\u201d</b><br /> Incarnation: Psychopomp<br /> Agenda: Integrator<br /> <a href=\"http://i169.photobucket.com/albums/u223/LeRoienJeune/Terry%20McTavert-1_zpsmgwiaewk.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">Human</a> <a href=\"http://i169.photobucket.com/albums/u223/LeRoienJeune/Markizel_zpsb2zv52bc.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a><br /> <br /> Markizel fell fairly recently, after questioning a number of the features of the world. He seemed to fixate on some more than others, such as chicken wings. He says he wants to improve the God-Machine, not destroy it, but other members of the Agency wonder if his trying to do one would lead to the other.<br /> <br /> As Terry McTavert, he has joined up with the Night Train Agency as a mechanic, which has, so far, made him useful enough not to be eaten. He approaches the world with a childlike naivet\u00e9, with occasional asides that can get him banned from anywhere with children. He is a McGuyver trope.<br /> <br /> Join us next week, where we continue to story, and see more of good ol Terry here. Comments and Questions welcome.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-27T02:19:35-07:00","id":853946,"title":"","content":"So there was a stakeout. What happened there? And what secrets do the movers and shakers have?<br /> <br /> As an aside, a girl named Penelope was in this session. Naomi, who is an asshole, called her Pent-ah-lope. Speed\u2019s player attempted to get this across by spelling Penelope Penalope. Also my spell-check hates me now. Finally, Clytemnestra\u2019s fic timewise took place at the beginning of the session but was not RP\u2019d. I still thought it was nice.<br /> <br /> <i>Session XXXVIII</i><br /> <br /> <b>Speed Demon\u2019s Monologues</b><br /> <br /> There were still a couple of hours before go time at Kiki\u2019s when I\u2019d finished up my research. I grabbed my hat. The sister\u2019s apartment should be a quick in and out milk job, so that was plenty of time. I ducked my head into the lab as I left. \u201cHey g-man. I\u2019m gonna hit the fucking pavement a bit, check on the sister\u2019s apartment. It\u2019s probably a goddamn wash, but there\u2019s nothing better to do, for now.\u201d<br /> <br /> He looked up from his work. \u201cWould you like company?\u201d<br /> <br /> I shrugged. He took it for an invitation. We made good time to the Rain City Arms. It was a nice enough place, not a shithole but not a fucking penthouse. There wasn\u2019t much to go on, but at this point anything would come from the apartment manager and their records, not from the apartment itself. So I tried to straighten out my rumpled jacket and put on a goddamn smile.<br /> <br /> A twenty something brunette was sitting at the desk, using a tablet to video chat with a mixed race kid. She looked up and nodded as we walked in. She looked back to the tablet. \u201cOK sweetie, I have to go.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOK Mommy, bye!\u201d The kid waved as the feed cut out.<br /> <br /> She smiled brightly at us. I nodded a hello and leaned on the goddamn counter. \u201cHello ma\u2019am. I\u2019m looking into the disappearance of someone who lived here.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYou with the police?\u201d She waited fucking expectantly.<br /> <br /> \u201cNo, private investigators,\u201d Billy Mack responded, reaching into his jacket.<br /> <br /> We showed her our licenses and she looked over them but gave us a skeptical look. \u201cI may or may not be able to help you. Privacy is important to our clients. We don\u2019t want to let abusive partners find any of our residents, former or otherwise, for instance.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOf course. That is an excellent policy.\u201d Billy Mack nodded.<br /> <br /> She smiled. \u201cThere might be something I can give you though. What\u2019s the first and last name?\u201d<br /> <br /> I leaned forward, rolling my eyes at the fucking foibles of the world and tweaking reality to loosen her lips a little. \u201cHer first name\u2019s Rosalyn. She lived in 204 and went missing around a month and a half ago.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOh, her. Her leaving was suspicious. Here, lemme...\u201d She dug around for a file and showed it to me. \u201cThe contact information is all false - we checked them when she disappeared.\u201d That meant all I got from the file was a goddamn last name and a picture. The last name was Jacobson and the picture was as fucking much of the girl in Nikka\u2019s childhood memory as Jack was. That was a hell of an angle.<br /> <br /> \u201cSo what happened? She skipped out, I guess, if you had to try the emergency contacts,\u201d I prodded her to expand.<br /> <br /> She nodded, frowning a little. \u201cThere was a break in, actually. It set the alarm off, called the police. They said she hadn\u2019t been there in a few days, something about security cameras catching her leaving in the evening. We haven\u2019t heard anything since.\u201d<br /> <br /> I really fucking hated the thought of leaning on Mac so soon after letting him down. Hopefully other goddamn leads would pan out. \u201cWas it odd for her to have left like that?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI dunno.\u201d She shrugged. \u201cThe odd thing happened later. A somewhat... alluring woman came asking for her.\u201d I described Nikka. \u201cYeah. She said Rosalyn was her sister - I guess she was adopted? She wanted to get into the apartment, but the police had already been through it, we\u2019d even given away all her effects to charity. And with her not being on the contact list...\u201d She sighed, an odd appreciative smile on her face and a fucking far off look in her eyes. \u201cI should have stopped her from smoking indoors.\u201d<br /> <br /> I smirked. \u201cYou really want to tell<u><u>her</u></u> to stop doing something like that?\u201d She shrugged knowingly.<br /> <br /> Billy Mack gave me a look before turning to the girl. \u201cThank you for your time. You have a good evening.\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> Terry got to Kiki\u2019s a little before the rest of us, snagging a table and ordering a goddamn awful amount of fucking chicken wings. He looked around, taking in the ambiance, including Daniel Goddamn Dovetonsils in his fucking rabbit suit. After a moment, his eyes widened even more from his usual deer in the headlights look. He dug into his chicken wings, keeping a quick eye on the crowd.<br /> <br /> \u201cHello sir.\u201d A nasally voice spoke from behind him. \u201cMy name is Darling Daniel Dovetonsils...\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cDid you pick that?\u201d Terry interrupted.<br /> <br /> The fucker looked nonplussed. \u201cNo, it was given to me. Would you care for a free signpost for visiting the white rabbit? You can even purchase more, but I do like to keep Saturday... vivid.\u201d<br /> <br /> Terry looked quickly around. \u201cSure.\u201d He took the tab Ducknostrils held out to him and put it in his pocket.<br /> <br /> \u201cIf you wish to purchase more, I\u2019ll be around.\u201d He gestured vaguely towards the other side of the goddamn club.<br /> <br /> \u201cHave you eaten? I\u2019ve got...\u201d Terry mirrored his gesture in the direction of his pile of chicken wings.<br /> <br /> \u201cNo thank...\u201d The rabbit suited motherfucker trailed off as he looked up behind Terry and caught sight of Jack coming towards him. He smiled nervously at Terry and moved quickly to the other side of the room.<br /> <br /> The song \u2018For What It\u2019s Worth\u2019 started playing as soon as I walked in the door, a little behind Jack. Billy Mack raised an eyebrow as I stopped and took a fucking look around. I shrugged and we followed Jack over to Terry\u2019s table.<br /> <br /> We\u2019d barely had time to sit down and be offered his goddamn chicken wings when Naomi and her inner circle walked in. Classy as fucking usual, the pink cursive \u2018Homewrecker\u2019 on her shirt was underscored by the silhouette of a bed draped in women\u2019s underwear. She shooed her girls over to a booth and sauntered over to us. \u201cHey guys. I didn\u2019t know it was Senior\u2019s Night.\u201d<br /> <br /> Jack gritted his