ng well? Since that\u2019s what you care about, \u201cNaomi grinned.<br /> <br /> \u201cI care about you! You have to tell me what happened. I wanted to visit\u2026\u201d<br /> <br /> <i>I was having a good time. I wish I could have told you that\u2026</i><br /> <br /> \u201cDoctors, then on to hospitals, lotta waiting. Fortunately, got Cassandra\u2019s poultices through customs. \u201c<br /> <br /> \u201cSo she can just cure people?\u201d Deanna looked disbelieving.<br /> <br /> Naomi rolled her eyes, \u201cNo, well, I don\u2019t think so. I mean, the poultice is not exactly easy to make, I am not exactly a stranger either. She and I have shared a bed a few times and our biorhythms are somewhat linked. But\u2026not as linked as yours and mine are cutie. No one is linked to me like you are.\u201d<br /> <br /> Deanna smiled.<br /> <br /> \u201cAnd medicine played a part. I don\u2019t\u2026\u201d Naomi gave a calculated vulnerable look. \u201cI don\u2019t really want to talk about it right now. It was everything for, what a month?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI so sorry,\u201d Deanna hugged her close. The spider\u2019s mechanical heart fluttered smelling her hair. \u201cI\u2019ll stop. School has been fine.\u201d<br /> <br /> The Spider warred with herself a moment, and made a decision.<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019m\u2026gonna try to be nicer to you Deanna. I care about you, I just suck at it.\u201d Naomi looked serious.<br /> <br /> \u201cIf this is a joke, I will be super pissed. If not\u2026thanks.\u201d<br /> <br /> <i>It\u2019s not a joke!</i><br /> <br /> \u201cWhat do you think?\u201d Naomi smiled enigmatically. \u201cSorry bad start. It\u2019s not a joke.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI feel like I will wake and this was a dream,\u201d Deanna sighed.<br /> <br /> \u201cWell I am here a bit, but Cassandra wants me and a few specific others, Am and Angela I think, with her tonight. We will be going out in about four hours. But it is four hours I\u2019d like to spend with you?\u201d Naomi\u2019s tone was hopeful.<br /> <br /> <i>You are only not coming to be sure you are safe!</i><br /> <br /> \u201cOf course!\u201d Deanna said quickly. The Spider\u2019s heart leapt.<br /> <br /> \u201cYou will have time to study?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cTonight!\u201d Deanna offered quickly.<br /> <br /> Naomi carefully stroked Deanna\u2019s hair. The Spider was so fond of it. Deanna\u2019s eyes closed as she smiled. \u201cYou are finally here again. It is you.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cIt\u2019s me babe. And no one else.\u201d<br /> <br /> The Spider smiled, her heart content.<br /> <br /> <i>End Session XXXVIII</i><br /> <br /> Hee hee hee hee\u2026Sharon Needles and Robin Graves. Hee hee hee hee<br /> <br /> It\u2019s not apparent from the text, but Kiki is the first Trans character in the game. Admittedly, she is also a Ghost, but you know. My ghosts tend to be complicated characters on their own.<br /> <br /> Naomi was using Sonic Acuity to eavesdrop on the room, hence giving Gabe updates. She had that and Nightvision going on. Gabe was using Mind Reading, obviously. Naomi also came by the table and dropped Idle Conversation on it.<br /> <br /> For more about Harvesters, see the Immortals book.<br /> <br /> So Baroness, you are probably asking, what the hell is with the alligator. Oh just you wait. Find out more in two weeks. Comments and Questions welcome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-o