 /> <br /> \u201cSpeaking of - I need to hit the fight, Herb asked me in goddamn particular.\u201d I spiked my coffee and took a sip.<br /> <br /> \u201cLiz has no reason to go to the fight, so she can watch over Nikka. I\u2019d like someone with her though. And with you.\u201d She pointed at me.<br /> <br /> I ran a finger around the rim of my fucking mug. \u201cI\u2019ll take Jack. I can get us there fucking quick, if I get a message, and Billy Mack can keep an eye on us and have extra warning to make up time.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAnd that makes four, which, since Hors d\u2019Oeuvres is not back around, is all of us.\u201d Naomi smiled.<br /> <br /> \u201cIt is odd. I do not know where he is, perhaps he is with Phil.\u201d Billy Mack looked goddamn thoughtful. \u201cHe\u2019s not been on the news, so perhaps something I told him has taken root.\u201d<br /> <br /> Naomi shrugged. \u201cWell, we\u2019ll leave a message for Elevensies in case he wants to join us.\u201d<br /> <br /> Billy Mack looked down at the table, tapping his fingers. \u201cShelley is working tomorrow night I believe, however...\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cIt\u2019d be better to have a recognizable detective there. For appearances, that kinda shit.\u201d I rolled my shoulders back.<br /> <br /> Naomi smirked at Billy Mack. \u201cI promise not to seduce Shelley.\u201d<br /> <br /> Billy Mack inclined his head. \u201cI appreciate it.\u201d<br /> <br /> I rolled my eyes. \u201cWe found our gentleman of the road. Well, we found out his name: Skeevy Larry.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSounds appropriate.\u201d Naomi made a face.<br /> <br /> \u201cHe does fucking odd jobs in that area. Worked a butcher shop until a few days ago.\u201d I took a drink. \u201cBrought a fucking anaconda to work once.\u201d<br /> <br /> Billy Mack smiled slightly. \u201cOh? Did I miss \u2018Bring your anaconda to work\u2019 day? It\u2019s so easy to miss.\u201d<br /> <br /> Naomi chuckled. \u201cI hate I\u2019m not wearing Liz to make a smart comment about that.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWe ran into Heather. She bit a guy in half.\u201d Jack smirked. \u201cAnd Famine, one of Robin\u2019s friends, who seems to know Heather.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOh?\u201d Naomi raised an eyebrow.<br /> <br /> I shrugged. \u201cShe had her pegged as soon as Jack said a goddamn dragon had done it. Seemed to scare the shit out of her.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOr... she thought Jack meant Mary, from Whacko Bob\u2019s.\u201d Naomi looked disapprovingly at us.<br /> <br /> \u201cI thought Mary was an ice giant.\u201d Now it was Billy Mack\u2019s turn to look disapprovingly at me.<br /> <br /> Naomi rolled her eyes at me and looked significantly at Jack. \u201cYou were on your best behavior.\u201d<br /> <br /> I smirked at him. \u201cHe was fucking flirting with the bitch.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cShe did offer to go out with me.\u201d The fixer had a smug smile.<br /> <br /> \u201cIf you set the Black Beast on fire.\u201d I looked expectantly at him. He flipped me off.<br /> <br /> Naomi gave him a stern look. He held his hands up. \u201cI didn\u2019t come up with it.\u201d<br /> <br /> Naomi shook her head. \u201cSo what about you Gabe? Who are you going to seduce in the Rain City Mafia?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSharon did strike me as the reasonable sort.\u201d Billy Mack answered first. \u201cIf we\u2019re divvying them up, I\u2019ll take Sharon.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSo whoever\u2019s left is Speed\u2019s.\u201d Naomi fucking smirked at me.<br /> <br /> I rolled my eyes. \u201cI am not fucking the goddamn Burning Man.\u201d<br /> <br /> Naomi waved her hands. \u201cMunches and Crunches can have the Burning Man. I think there\u2019s another for you.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAnyway, I don\u2019t know how Famine figured out what we were, but she did, before we started in on the spooky stuff.\u201d Jack tried to steer things back the hell on track.<br /> <br /> \u201cSome of them have extrasensory powers, it was likely something like that.\u201d Naomi shrugged.<br /> <br /> \u201cShe died in that fight with the Black Beast, that\u2019s why she wants it lit on fire. It bit her head off and grew a copy of it. It got me thinking -\u201d Jack began.<br /> <br /> Naomi choked on her fucking drink. \u201cHead swallowing made you think of what?\u201d<br /> <br /> He glared at her. \u201cThat she has a death that she doesn\u2019t want.\u201d<br /> <br /> Billy Mack clapped him on the goddamn shoulder. \u201cTime is money. Always be closing.\u201d He hid a smile behind his coffee cup.<br /> <br /> \u201cHeather says she\u2019s been studying all day. And reminded me that Korra is tomorrow.\u201d Naomi looked up from her phone.<br /> <br /> \u201cTo be fair, she think you\u2019re human right? So she\u2019s not gonna say \u2018oh, I want down to the laundromat and bit a woman in half\u2019.\u201d Jack shrugged.<br /> <br /> Naomi ignored him, her eyes widening. \u201cOh shit.\u201d<br /> <br /> The mug stopped halfway to Jack\u2019s mouth. \u201cWhat?!\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cShe heard I slept with Adria.\u201d Naomi sighed.<br /> <br /> \u201cI do recall Heather was creepily nice to her. Do tread carefully.\u201d Billy Mack looked at her fucking gravely.<br /> <br /> Naomi nodded. \u201cI\u2019m smoothing it over, trying to convince her I\u2019m not involved with her.\u201d She sighed again. \u201cGoddamn it Heather. Hey, maybe she killed that woman to try and deal with her emotions.\u201d<br /> <br /> Billy Mack nodded approvingly. \u201cShe does seem to try to channel her feelings to worthwhile ends. It\u2019s admirable.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI don\u2019t think she realizes how much Adria actively dislikes her.\u201d Naomi frowned at her fucking phone. \u201cI think she\u2019s been drinking.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThat seems not in the best interests of the countryside or those who would prefer to not be burninated.\u201d Billy Mack ate the last bite of his pie.<br /> <br /> The pink haired girl typed on her phone, shaking her head. \u201cShe thinks she\u2019s just too shy to talk to Adria. I really don\u2019t want to be the one to tell her Adria thinks she\u2019s creepy.\u201d<br /> <br /> Billy Mack frowned. \u201cUnfortunate. Heather seems nice enough.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cEh, Adria\u2019s not good for long term relationships anyway.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cPerhaps we should endeavor to find her a better option,\u201d Billy Mack mused.<br /> <br /> Naomi looked goddamn thoughtful. \u201cThere was a guy. I don\u2019t know much about him though.\u201d<br /> <br /> The g-man made an interested noise. \u201cCould you get more details and send them to me? I would like to look into him.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cMaybe...\u201d Naomi looked fucking dubious.<br /> <br /> \u201cThe last thing anyone flammable needs is for her backup crush to be undeserving.\u201d Billy Mack met her gaze with raised eyebrows.<br /> <br /> Naomi sighed heavily. \u201cFair enough.\u201d She looked back down at her phone. \u201cI think she believes my \u2018thing\u2019 with Adria isn\u2019t long term at least.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cIt is hard to be good friends and maintain cover. I imagine it helps that you\u2019re not known for...\u201d<br /> <br /> I interrupted the g-man. \u201cBeing a good friend?\u201d<br /> <br /> Naomi flipped me the hell off. \u201cI\u2019m always nice to Heather, for whatever reason.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cCause you\u2019re afraid of her?\u201d I suggested.<br /> <br /> \u201cThat,\u201d she pointed at me, \u201cis true, in and out of character.\u201d<br /> <br /> Billy Mack cleared his goddamn throat. \u201cWhat I was going to say was that you are not known for her long term relationships.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYeah.\u201d Naomi nodded. \u201cShe\u2019ll get over it. She didn\u2019t get this upset at Deanna. Which is good. If she hurt Deanna, she\u2019d be spider food.\u201d She started typing again. \u201cI'm just going to have to cool her ardor without killing her ego.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019m sure you will excel at it.\u201d Billy Mack smiled at her.<br /> <br /> Jack flagged the waitress down for a refill and once she was gone, looked at Naomi. \u201cSo - Dr. Fang. What\u2019s the plan? An overt show of force, lurking, ambush, what?\u201d<br /> <br /> Naomi thought for a moment. \u201cLurking, I think, keeping an eye out for mind control. I can Demon form if he makes a physical move.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI can go Demon beforehand and be around invisibly,\u201d Jack offered.<br /> <br /> \u201cExcellent. Then I can disperse via spiders.\u201d Naomi smiled.<br /> <br /> Billy Mack looked between them. \u201cI imagine the idea is to correct any assumptions of weakness.\u201d Naomi nodded. \u201cGabe and I can look over Nikka, since you don\u2019t need a large display. I\u2019ll go past Dr. Hargrave\u2019s office, so I can keep an eye on the situation.\u201d<br /> <br /> Naomi shrugged. \u201cThe meeting\u2019s at nine.\u201d She stood and stretched. \u201cI\u2019m off to take Deanna to dinner at The Roost. You guys take care and don\u2019t forget to take your Geritol with dinner.\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Clytemnestra\u2019s Yarns</b><br /> <br /> To: Cassandra Bale &lt;<a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\" class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"4b123e25242722383f2e250b232e2a3f232e25262a222765282426\">[email&#160;protected]</a>&gt;, Amsterdam &lt;<a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\" class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"1350747261707667677a537b7672677b767d7e727a7f3d707c7e\">[email&#160;protected]</a>&gt;, A. Wilcox &lt;<a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\" class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"f1a19e9d88819096909fb19994908599949f9c90989ddf929e9c\">[email&#160;protected]</a>&gt;, NotCalifornia &lt;<a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\" class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"4b0808082a393824250b232e2a3f232e25262a222765282426\">[email&#160;protected]</a>&gt;, Rhymes With Calliope You Bitch &lt;<a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\" class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"6c3c09020900031c092c04090d18040902010d0500420f0301\">[email&#160;protected]</a>&gt;, 6 others<br /> <br /> From: Ms. Weaver &lt;<a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\" class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"246e4b564b4351494b646c4145504c414a49454d480a474b49\">[email&#160;protected]</a>&gt;<br /> <br /> Title: Operation: Mina's Revenge is go!<br /> <br /> Okay ladies and gentlemen, it\u2019s time to save Adria from the vampire. Rejoice!<br /> <br /> Most of you will be standing by outside the history building at 8:45 in case there is a problem, but a few specific things.<br /> <br /> First thing\u2019s first. Angela, your job is to be sure Heather Knight is okay. I know she is scary, but she is upset right now and we do not need her getting agitated. You have a way with people, and you are psychic, so keep an eye on things there. Note her favorite ice cream is white chocolate raspberry truffle. Use this knowledge well.<br /> <br /> Callie, you will be babysitting Adria. I don\u2019t expect any trouble from her, but she has been tainted by vampire blood, so she might act out of character. If she is too intense in a desire to meet her former master, don\u2019t physically put yourself in danger- text Cassandra and myself. I recommend playing some video games with her, whatever distracts.<br /> <br /> Cassandra, since you can access the roof more easily than anyone else can, you will be on top of the history building coordinating things. You should be able to see some distance in any direction and keep line of sight if a battle breaks out outdoors. Change rooftops if you have to but don\u2019t engage. You are my eyes in the outdoors and in charge of everything outside the building.<br /> <br /> Am, my concubine, you know your job. You are very brave. If you get the signal, set up and use the knife to open a vein. If I am right, even his self-preservation instincts shouldn\u2019t keep him from feeding when he smells your unusually tasty blood. Move if you need to, just keep him focused. Remember, if you die I resurrect you, I promise, and all of you see my promise. I do not expect it to come to that.<br /> <br /> Penelope You are my agent on the inside. If Am sacrifices herself, drive the stake into the Vampire\u2019s heart. You also have the Machete. You know what to do with it.<br /> <br /> It should not come to that.<br /> <br /> Dr. Hargrove will be expecting to meet Adria Instead, while Callie makes sure Adria is safe, I will be entering with some lesser gods as backup. My intent is peaceful negotiation. Sure, we CAN strike him from the board; he is just a vampire after all. But I prefer to watch him. He may become useful to us. Vampires have connections, and if we eliminate him he may have those connections investigate and find one of you, rather than me first. I don\u2019t want that.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, those connections could be our allies. If we can work out a mutually agreeable scenario that keeps you folks off the menu, we might be able to make the University even more tightly under our control. This could be useful especially if we start following up on what Cassandra was looking into.<br /> <br /> Okay, if you have any questions let me know. Be sure you delete this email after you read it and make a mental note of the contents. I have absolute faith in you. Together we are strong, and soon should get this done. Power to us!<br /> <br /> Ms. Weaver<br /> <br /> P.S. Seriously Am, even though it is from me delete this one.<br /> <br /> <i>End Session XLV</i><br /> <br /> Let\u2019s see\u2026<br /> <br /> It is difficult for me to put into words how sleazy the pic I have for Bobby Right is. I shall have to upload it so you can behold him in all his glory. Skeevy Larry has a differently horrid pic. Everything you heard about him was true.<br /> <br /> Jack rolled shit on his Spoofing roll, so Pham Min caught on that she was dealing with a demon fast. Pham stole a potential charm from the room.<br /> <br /> Quietus and Kilroy were using their Pacting abilities to give Ginny Right safe place.<br /> <br /> Reptoids are too much fun.<br /> <br /> Okay I think that covers everything. Comments and Questions welcome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":56,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","user":"Baroness Nerak","date":". 07-02-2016, 04:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-16T02:09:17-07:00","id":932446,"title":"","content":"Okay, so the group splits up to carrying on their evening surveillance and negotiation. What could go wrong?<br /> <br /> <i>Session XLVI</i><br /> <br /> <b>Speed Demon\u2019s Monologues</b><br /> <br /> Kilroy swapped to Vivian to stop by campus and she made her way to the building the history department was housed in. The lights in the hallway were on, even though most of the offices were dark and the secretary\u2019s desk was empty. Vivian looked towards each office with a fucking nervous expression, clutching a notebook. She let hope start to creep up on her face when she saw Dr. Hargrave\u2019s door open and hurried over.<br /> <br /> \u201cUm... do you know where Dr. Schubert\u2019s office is?\u201d She smiled pleadingly. \u201cI hope... I think he\u2019s in this building.\u201d<br /> <br /> Dr. Hargrave looked up from his polished hardwood desk, smiling pityingly at her. \u201cCorrect building, miss, incorrect floor.\u201d He gave her a room number. She grinned brightly and dashed the hell off.<br /> <br /> On her way out to the bus stop, she passed by a group of ten students moving goddamn purposefully. Vivian recognized Cassandra, Am, Penelope and the song they were humming in unison: Boadicea by Enya. She watched them continue towards the vampire professor\u2019s office, then hurried on to Kiki\u2019s to join me. <br /> <br /> It was a busy night at Kiki\u2019s, though some of the usuals weren\u2019t there. Hipster fuck number 27 was there and worried about something - probably the missing hipster broad number 18. Colleen Lung was there, drinking alone. The vampire Jack had gotten mind fucked by most recently was there was a dame who looked like she should be wearing a fucking tiara. Robin was off in a corner. I nodded a hello.<br /> <br /> I was thankful for my control over my expression when I looked over at the last table. Esha was there, with a bald fucker in a suit and glasses and the Triad\u2019s enforcer dame, the one that had been there with Two Chin before. I managed a straight face as I sat down, shooting a slight smile at Esha when she caught sight of me. She smiled back and her eyes caught in the light, glinting slightly blue.<br /> <br /> Vivian got there as I was settling in with a sour, taking a table by herself and flirting with Shelley. Billy Mack\u2019s Alibi showed up a little later and sat across from me. I nodded to him and put up Mind Reading and Aura Sight, giving the crowd a look see. I didn\u2019t get much - the enforcer dame was supernatural, something like a stigmatic, but not tied to the God Machine. The bald fucker was a mage, and it didn\u2019t take Demon powers to see the goddamn Team Tomorrow tie tack he was wearing.<br /> <br /> I gave the princess a quick look to confirm she was also a vampire, and Hipster Fuck one cause I\u2019m goddamn nosy. The burnt out druggie was worried that Cleo and \u2018Darling Daniel Dovetonsils\u2019 weren\u2019t around. Mostly missing the tail and drugs he was hoping to score respectively.<br /> <br /> The Triad enforcer was more interesting, largely in how intrigued she was by Esha and by extension Blue Sun. I wasn\u2019t jealous. It was more of a sizing up on the enforcer\u2019s part than a checking out, and there\u2019s nothing to be fucking jealous of anyway. She had some way of measuring power and Esha was off the goddamn charts. Damn impressive, but she didn\u2019t get any indication that the Team Tomorrow mage - one Dr. Gist according to her surface thoughts - had any power at all, so it wasn\u2019t some particularly brilliant piece of sensory work or anything. At least it meant I wasn\u2019t going to have to be keeping an eye on two dames. The enforcer had decided that kidnapping was way too dangerous, given Esha\u2019s power level.<br /> <br /> Apparently the Triad had been negotiating with both Blue Sun and Team Tomorrow. Respectable Ping was in the Team Tomorrow camp, while she was more interested in working with Blue Sun. But however it worked out, now they were facilitating a meetup between the two. She was way the fuck out of her element. This kinda thing was usually Two Chin\u2019s deal, but most of her non-threat assessing mental commentary was cursing whatever the hell kept him too busy.<br /> <br /> Leaving aside trying to find out where the fuck she was hiding the flying guillotine that I got a clear impression of her packing, I went digging for something on Kiki. If the Triad did have something to do with the bar owner\u2019s death, the enforcer didn\u2019t know anything about it. She knew there was a ghost, but was mostly hoping not to meet her, since she can\u2019t chop a ghost\u2019s head off.<br /> <br /> Billy Mack\u2019s Alibi and I kept up idle chitchat to maintain our cover and settled in for a long night and a goddamn lot of drinking. I had three empties sitting on the table when Robin stopped by. I nodded and gestured expansively across from me. Billy Mack scooted over to let her sit.<br /> <br /> She smiled and sat. \u201cHey guys. I heard you ran into Pham?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cIs that her proper name?\u201d I shrugged. \u201cLiz telling stories?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cNo, Pham said she killed you and took your stuff.\u201d Robin rolled her eyes. \u201cShe says that a lot. She\u2019s more mouthy, but less likely to kill you out of hand generally.\u201d<br /> <br /> I started walking a coin over my knuckles. \u201cStill got my shit. Jack got a fucking proposition too.\u201d Her eyes widened. \u201cYep. If he lights the goddamn thing in the basement on fire, he gets a date.\u201d<br /> <br /> Her panicked look grew. \u201cBut that\u2019s not gonna happen, cause you\u2019re not gonna go down there. You have no reason to, right?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWhoa, whoa, whoa.\u201d I help my hands up. \u201cI don\u2019t give two fucks. Hell, I don\u2019t give one. My shit\u2019s on the third floor. The basement is not my goddamn problem.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cIf she likes him, I\u2019m sure there are options not involving dying.\u201d She took a deep breath.<br /> <br /> Billy Mack nodded. \u201cIt is hard to go on a date when one is dead.\u201d<br /> <br /> Robin nodded and took another fucking deep breath. \u201cPham told me about the murder too. That is definitely someone we don\u2019t mess with though.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOut of curiosity...\u201d I remembered Liz\u2019s theory, \u201cwho do you think Jack meant by the dragon?\u201d<br /> <br /> She looked at me goddamn curiously. \u201cMary, the woman at the watermelon place?\u201d<br /> <br /> I looked at Billy Mack. \u201cI thought she was an ice giant.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThey are notoriously clever and effective shapeshifters.\u201d He looked back at me fucking sternly. \u201cI was merely considering all the options.\u201d<br /> <br /> Robin glanced between us, confused. \u201cWe were going by the way she moves...\u201d I continued looking at Billy Mack, fighting back a laugh. \u201cSo, it was a different dragon? What do they look like, so I don\u2019t, I dunno, hit them with a broom?\u201d<br /> <br /> I raised an eyebrow at her. \u201cA college student. A dame. So don\u2019t go hitting them with fucking brooms.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cShe has quite a striking death stare,\u201d Billy Mack added.<br /> <br /> \u201cFair enough.\u201d She looked around and changed the subject. \u201cIs Liz going to be around?\u201d<br /> <br /> I shook my head. \u201cShe\u2019s got business.\u201d<br /> <br /> The Sin-Eater looked fucking disappointed. \u201cDo you guys need any help?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cNah.\u201d I paused. \u201cWait a second.\u201d I got out the picture of the guy targeting Nikka, laying it on the table discreetly. \u201cYou seen this fuck before?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYeah. He doesn\u2019t age. He\u2019s affected by time but... in a weird way.\u201d She passed the picture back. \u201cThere\u2019s so much weird stuff to deal with, he\u2019s not been a high priority.\u201d<br /> <br /> Billy Mack looked significantly at where the picture had been. \u201cWe believe he is a Harvester.\u201d<br /> <br /> Both her eyebrows went right the fuck up. \u201cHe\u2019s more dangerous than we thought then.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYeah.\u201d I described Nikka. \u201cWhat about her?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cShe\u2019s weirdly ageless. I think she\u2019s Purified, which is a pain in the ass.\u201d<br /> <br /> I cleared my throat. \u201cThe Harvester\u2019s after her. And we\u2019re stopping him.\u201d<br /> <br /> She shifted back. \u201cWe Sin-Eaters have different ideas about things dying as they should. As long as they\u2019re not hurting others to do it, I\u2019m fine with it. Sharon has other ideas. For Pham... it depends on how cute they are.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWell that is important,\u201d Billy Mack put in.<br /> <br /> She narrowed her eyes at him before looking back at me. \u201cIf you plan on killing him...\u201d<br /> <br /> I held my hands up. \u201cNot the plan.\u201d I noticed Esha looking in my direction, eyes flickering a goddamn blue. I put my hands down and made sure there was distance between me and Robin.<br /> <br /> \u201cIf you don\u2019t care whether he kills another immortal, then if it gets too hot, he\u2019ll probably move on.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOther immortals aren\u2019t hot and paying for my help. I can\u2019t fucking protect all of them.\u201d Out of the corner of my eyes,