appen if we kill him or scare him too much.\u201d<br /> <br /> He let out a deep fucking breath. \u201cIt\u2019s not a done deal, is all.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cNot by a long shot,\u201d Naomi agreed. \u201cEverything has to be done carefully.\u201d She smiled at him. \u201cThanks for looking out though. At this time, he benefits.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAt this time...\u201d <br /> <br /> Nikka\u2019s place was about as nice on the inside as it was on the outside. Talking wasn\u2019t the first thing on our minds once we actually got there, but she spent a lot of time doing her best to thoroughly convince me she was better than Esha. It was a hell of a night, that\u2019s for damn sure.<br /> <br /> When I woke up before she did, I couldn\u2019t help but take a look around her place. Most everything looked Eastern European and old - a lot of newspapers in Croat, some in Serbian. I didn\u2019t have time to go digging too deep, but I did see a headline announcing the fall of the Berlin Wall.<br /> <br /> The only exception to the theme was a single, spotless room. It was clearly well fucking cared for, with a Native American theme and a single picture of a native woman. There weren\u2019t a whole lot of pictures other than that one, which did a little to counter the old person feel the rest of the house gave off.<br /> <br /> We eventually discussed goddamn Harvesters, over breakfast. It was largely what Billy Mack had told us, without the whole tailored towards my actual level of knowledge thing. I headed out after breakfast, stopping by my apartment for a quick shower before making my way to the office.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Clytemnestra\u2019s Yarns</b><br /> <br /> Hey Kayla?<br /> <br /> Hey Baby.<br /> <br /> Yea I\u2019m fine. You\u2019re off work right?<br /> <br /> I\u2019m fine.<br /> <br /> Okay, can you come down?<br /> <br /> No, the Vampire thing went fine but\u2026that fucker tried to mind control Naomi.<br /> <br /> No, I would not \u201conly know if she apologized for something.\u201d<br /> <br /> Anyway, people shouldn\u2019t do that shit to Naomi.<br /> <br /> Yea, we made a deal, figured we would. Always gotta be careful with Cold Ones.<br /> <br /> Yeah.<br /> <br /> Yeah.<br /> <br /> But you\u2019re not here. Why?<br /> <br /> No I\u2019ve already eaten. Am is passed out here.<br /> <br /> She is cute isn\u2019t she? I could wake her up, but she won\u2019t be very energetic.<br /> <br /> Speed got into a gunfight over that immortal when some other immortals. Well, they brought knives, she brought guns.<br /> <br /> Yes, one is going to the morgue. She is not going to the hospital why?<br /> <br /> Oh.<br /> <br /> We are not in Chicago. And I notice you are not here.<br /> <br /> Yea Baby.<br /> <br /> Do I have to say it out loud? I need you here right now.<br /> <br /> Okay, now you tell me.<br /> <br /> See you soon then. Love you bitch.<br /> <br /> Usually. Bye.<br /> <br /> <i>End Session XLVI</i><br /> <br /> Fun fun!<br /> <br /> The \u201cDame who looked like she should be wearing a Tiara\u201d has a Tiara on in her pic. The \u201clooks like a stigmatic but isn\u2019t\u201d was pretty much a psychic, but not a run of the mill one; she is a Biokenetic, and can move stats around, as well as alter her perception of time so people seem to move slower (halves opposing Defense and doubles hers, costs 1 Wp per round it is active) which makes use of her flying guillotine better (instantly lethal to \u201cnormal\u201d characters, and demons in human form, if she gets 5 successes to hit. Supernaturals depend; vampires with Resilience are made of sterner stuff, for example, and Sin-Eaters can spend 5 Plasm to give her a Plasmic head and be utterly unhurt (this forces an Integrity check on her with a penalty). She can also sense psychics, Sin-Eaters, and manifested ghosts. Psychics (including Stigmatics) vary in threat level depending on dots possessed, ghosts are always dangerous but vary based on rank, and if she ever uses it on a Sin-Eater she will get the psychic equivalent of a flashing sign saying RUN. Note she cannot see unmanifested ghosts, and has to use the power deliberately.<br /> <br /> Hargrove, a Mekhet, is pretty skilled at Auspex, but less so at Dominate. Naomi shrugged off the attempt to Mesmerize her, and so he had to change tactics. Quietus never noticed him astrally projecting behind him for awhile though (he did not follow Naomi as he already knew where she lived).<br /> <br /> This was a bad night for Kilroy. Mr. Gone was already well protected by mind magic when an intrusion was attempted. She got a chance die and Gone realized she had attempted to read his mind\u2026but had never seen Vivian in conjunction with Gabe\u2019s Agency. Then he elected to use a fallen Harvester\u2019s weapon to finish off another Harvester, without considering killing an Immortal would heal and empower the first one. So they wound up with one beaten down (and killed) instead of two. The convoluted attack was the Cause and Effect Embed.<br /> <br /> Nothing else coming to me. If there are Comments or Questions let me know.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play