peg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T06:07:54-07:00","id":938053,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baroness Nerak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play?p=933034#post933034\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That I cannot contradict.<br /> <br /> Also, next session Terry is back and oh my god you guys, when you see what he has been up to, well, what that he recalls...</div> </div> </div> </div>Good. Terry's involvement is proving to be some of the most humorous to date.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-27T11:59:16-07:00","id":938254,"title":"","content":"This continues that tradition, I assure you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-30T00:48:33-07:00","id":939990,"title":"","content":"So you may have wondered, what could Markizel have been up to while all this was going on? Where has he been?<br /> <br /> Prepare to be enlightened.<br /> <br /> <i>Session XLVII</i><br /> <br /> <b>Speed Demon\u2019s Monologues<br /> </b><br /> Terry felt a rush of power go through him. He blinked a few times, looking around confusedly. He wasn\u2019t sure where the hell he was, but it looked a little like a museum. As he brought his hands down slowly, keeping careful hold of the warm red crystal, the hood of his black robe fell back to his shoulders. Trying to regain his concentration, whatever the fuck he\u2019d ever had of it, he felt around for pockets. He didn\u2019t find any, just a holstered pistol paired with a holstered bottle of a buffalo sauce.<br /> <br /> A booming voice was coming from the crystal, speaking in a language Terry didn\u2019t understand. He looked around at the mass of cultists, most of them armed with knives. None of them had plague doctor masks. They did look kinda fucking familiar. Something about it suggested Phil to him. Maybe it was the two unconscious children.<br /> <br /> The cultist nearest him looked at him with concern. \u201cBrother, are you alright?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cDon\u2019t take this the wrong way,\u201d Terry began. \u201cI\u2019m sure lots of work went into this... I\u2019ll ask plainly - I\u2019m assuming there\u2019s no chicken wings...\u201d One of the cultists held up a pair of buckets with the Wing Dome logo on the side. Two more of the fucking things were sitting at their feet. \u201cOh. Well then.\u201d<br /> <br /> The door burst open in front of a crowd of robed people with plague doctor masks. The one in the lead pointed at the crystal Terry was holding. \u201cThat\u2019s it! Brother, you have it! Come and let us use it to end the world!\u201d<br /> <br /> Terry\u2019s eyes widened as a fight started to break out. He tweaked reality to nip that shit in the bud. He pointed at one of the first set of cultists, tucking the goddamn gem under his arm. \u201cYou, with the chicken wings -\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYes, disaster prince?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThose two kids, do they have names?\u201d The cultist shrugged. \u201cOK, Mary and, uh, Skip. What kinda party is this, how\u2019s this gonna play out? They\u2019re drugged, it looks like.\u201d<br /> <br /> The cultist looked at him, fucking confused. \u201cWe have to empower the crystal with the blood of the innocent.\u201d<br /> <br /> Terry raised his voice, looking around. \u201cAnyone else innocent?\u201d He lowered his voice, addressing the chicken wing cultist. \u201cOr does it have to be kids?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYou seemed gung-ho about children earlier.\u201d The hooded figure shrugged.<br /> <br /> \u201cOh. Well. Sorry, low blood sugar. Look, this is how it\u2019s gonna go...\u201d<br /> <br /> A fucking plague doctor masked cultist interrupted him. \u201cAre we going to end the world now brother?\u201d<br /> <br /> A non-masked cultist shot a goddamn dirty look at the other. \u201cNot until we sacrifice Jesus to Satan.\u201d<br /> <br /> Terry shifted into his full fucking Demon form and the lights flickered and died. He disappeared and reappeared next to the children, grabbing one in each arm. He grabbed one of the goddamn buckets of chicken wings with his fourth and last free arm. Another flicker and he was outside, standing horizontally on the wall. The light post near him popped and died.<br /> <br /> He teleported to the roof of a nearby building. At least eight fucking sirens wailed across the pink-purple predawn sky. He watched the lead car stop and a detective, an older balding man in a suit, stepped out. As he got close to the entrance he held a hand out. \u201cThe energy spike came from in there. There\u2019s no time to explain, gentlemen, I\u2019m sorry.\u201d Feathery fucking wings made of energy sprouted from his back and he drew a glowing sword as he ran into the goddamn museum.<br /> <br /> Terry kept hopping roofs until he recognized something, then headed towards the agency office, a trail of flickering lights a few buildings long behind him. He got there just after fucking dawn to find it closed, so he hopped roofs back to his goddamn apartment. He squinted at his door when he found it locked. He shifted one of the kids over his shoulder and brought out his laser cutter, cutting a hole around the door knob.<br /> <br /> He almost knocked over a walking stick, maneuvering in with his burdens. He shuffled through carefully, avoiding the forty or so hypodermic needles that were scattered around. Back in his bedroom, he shifted a couple of the fucktons of balloon animals off his bed and set the kids down. After a moment\u2019s thought, he set the bucket of chicken wings next to them.<br /> <br /> The mechanic tapped a finger on Skip\u2019s chest. \u201cYou alive?\u201d He felt for a pulse and breath sounds. When he found them, he shrugged and grabbed a spare pillow, dumping in out and putting the goddamn crystal in its case.<br /> <br /> In his living room the TV was on, a rerun of fucking Arsenio Hall playing. He started to push it in front of the door when a wide eyed shaggy haired lug poked his head in. \u201cHey man - you got anymore of that rotisserie?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSure.\u201d Terry shrugged.<br /> <br /> The gee started rummaging through the fridge. \u201cYou have a lot of jello. How much does one person need?\u201d<br /> <br /> Terry shrugged again and called Jack. The fixer answered fucking groggily. \u201cWhat the fuck do you want?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cDo we need two children, specifically?\u201d Terry asked.<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019ll repeat myself. Once. What the fuck do you want?\u201d Jack levered himself up, shifting to a sitting position.<br /> <br /> Terry looked goddamn philosophical. \u201cWhat does anyone want, really? Lemme just say, I can\u2019t live here anymore.\u201d<br /> <br /> The guy looked up from his plate of cold fucking rotisserie chicken. \u201cAw, it\u2019s not so bad.\u201d<br /> .<br /> \u201cIt\u2019s not really. I just can\u2019t stay <u>here</u>.\u201d He pointed down.<br /> <br /> \u201cWho the fuck are you talking to?\u201d Jack stretched, slowly waking up.<br /> <br /> Terry shrugged. \u201cKyle.\u201d<br /> <br /> Kyle looked between him and his phone and shrugged as well. \u201cThere\u2019s a room free upstairs. Neo-nazis killed my neighbor. I can help move your stuff.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cNah.\u201d Terry waved that aside. \u201cYou can have my stuff.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cReally? Thanks man!\u201d He looked around.<br /> <br /> Terry nodded. \u201cSure. Just... if a guy who really likes balloon animals show up, share with him.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cTerry.\u201d Jack spoke goddamn sharply. \u201cWhat are you asking about children?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI have two.\u201d Terry started rummaging around for clothes.<br /> <br /> Jack paused. \u201cWhat?\u201d<br /> <br /> He stepped aside to a different room to change. \u201cThey\u2019re drugged.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cTerry, I am going to kill you. Put you in a hole. And tell Liz where to find you.\u201d Jack rubbed his fucking forehead.<br /> <br /> \u201cThey\u2019re breathing.\u201d Kyle called out from the back, putting away the small mirror he\u2019d held under their noses.<br /> <br /> \u201cI don\u2019t know what they\u2019re drugged with. It was maybe a heroin party?\u201d Terry picked up a handful of bandaid trash, looked around at the goddamn piles of that shit on the floor, shrugged and tossed it aside.<br /> <br /> Kyle fucking cut one of the kids\u2019 arms and tasted the goddamn blood. \u201cNope, not heroin.\u201d He got a bandaid from the king-sized box and patched the kid up.<br /> <br /> Terry nodded to him. \u201cSo, can you come pick me up?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYou know I have no car, right?\u201d Jack sniffed at a coffee mug that had been sitting on the counter.<br /> <br /> \u201cOh.\u201d<br /> <br /> He filled it with cola from a two liter. \u201cA kid in a c