See you soon love.\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> She greeted me at the door with a kiss and a smile. \u201cI missed you last night.\u201d<br /> <br /> I winced inwardly. We needed to deal with the Harvesters and fast, before I fucked things up properly. Then Nikka could get back to LA, and I can forget all about this. No long term undercover work requiring permission involved. I smiled wryly at her. \u201cYeah, sorry beautiful. The security gig, you know.\u201d<br /> <br /> She took my hand and led us to the kitchen where she had bottles of whiskey and sour mix sitting out. She pulled a tumbler with ice out from the fridge. \u201cSo, why do you have the crystal?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYou know that guy Terry?\u201d She nodded. \u201cHe\u2019s been missing since Tuesday.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cDid you check Liz\u2019s place for his clothes?\u201d She smiled slightly.<br /> <br /> I grinned. \u201cNah, I just wrote him off as a runner, honestly. But he came out of some kind of fucking fugue state today at whenever before dawn is, in the museum, holding a crystal that was speaking to him in a language he didn\u2019t understand.\u201d<br /> <br /> She looked surprised. \u201cYou can hear it? It\u2019s Atlantean that it\u2019s speaking.\u201d She took a sip of her drink. \u201cGone is looking for it. One of the Free Council mages came by. We had a lovely luncheon.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cDo we need to have Jack kill someone? He really wants to kill someone.\u201d I tossed back my own drink.<br /> <br /> \u201cWe had a pleasant discussion, that\u2019s all. We talked about the Tic Tok men. I didn\u2019t know I was covering for you.\u201d She smiled, but it faded after a moment. \u201cI hadn\u2019t known they were aware I was back.\u201d She shook her head. \u201cBut how did Terry get it?\u201d<br /> <br /> I shrugged. \u201cHe doesn\u2019t remember. Something to do with a cult.\u201d<br /> <br /> She frowned. \u201cThe Temple of the Endless Void?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cNah.\u201d I took a sip. \u201cA different one, run by a Frater Pietr. They wanna sacrifice some Jesus kid to Satan so that after he rules for 1000 years, Jesus can destroy him from the inside out.\u201d I let out a noisy breath. \u201cHe is now a brother of the Temple of the Endless Void, since he apparently killed someone with ricin for them while he was out.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThe crystal can magnify magical abilities. It\u2019s dangerous - you could try to lob a fireball and wind up incinerating a neighborhood.\u201d Miranda thought for a moment. \u201cI think it\u2019d be best to give it back to the Free Council. They probably won\u2019t do anything crazy with it. Especially if we do it in a way so that everyone knows they have it back.\u201d She looked thoughtful. \u201cPerhaps it would help figure out how the wards were broken without alerting anyone.\u201d<br /> <br /> I finished my drink. \u201cOh, I forgot to mention - a chaos spirit named Phil might be involved.\u201d<br /> <br /> She raised an eyebrow. \u201cSetting them on this Phil guy might distract them from who returns it. I can do that without implicating you as well.\u201d<br /> <br /> I smiled a thanks and poured another goddamn sour. \u201cIt\u2019d be great if he disappeared.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cIf it was him, he\u2019s very powerful,\u201d she mused.<br /> <br /> \u201cIt would be really great if <u>they</u> made him disappear.\u201d I raised my glass to her. \u201cYou want the crystal now?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cHow about last thing before you leave?\u201d She smiled at me over her drink. \u201cI know a couple of other factions I can contact and let them know where it\u2019ll be. If they ask, I\u2019ll smile mysteriously.\u201d<br /> <br /> I looked at her with concern. \u201cYou\u2019ll be safe?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019ll smile mysteriously in a way that implies I didn't take it.\u201d She sat back, thinking. \u201cI wonder what it is they thought they could do with it.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThey were going to sacrifice some kids to the crystal, so I guess they think it\u2019s Satan?\u201d I shrugged, tapping my glass.<br /> <br /> She took a sip of her drink. \u201cThey are probably insane, but that is maybe an indication of a malign intelligence. You said it tried to communicate with you?\u201d I nodded. \u201cIt must have thought you could do something with it. I was under the impression it only talked to mages...\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> When we all scattered, Terry called Kyle. He answered fucking enthusiastically. \u201cSup!\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cHey man - how\u2019s it going?\u201d Terry started walking.<br /> <br /> \u201cFine. How\u2019s those kids?\u201d<br /> <br /> Terry shrugged. \u201cWe gave them back to the cops.\u201d<br /> <br /> Kyle nodded approvingly. \u201cGood, good. Best to not even consider how much you could get for one on the black market. And for two - whew! It\u2019s a good thing you\u2019re morally upright.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cIt helps me sleep,\u201d the fucker agreed. \u201cThat and any number of drugs. I\u2019m gonna move into that empty apartment, I think.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cGreat! It\u2019s paid through the month.\u201d Kyle shifted the phone to his other shoulder. \u201cYou want a key? I had his spare. And your stuff? I haven't taken all of it. I can move it up.\u201d<br /> <br /> Terry waved a hand. \u201cNah. The key\u2019d be good though. Leave it under the mat?\u201d<br /> <br /> Kyle made a fucking dismissive noise. \u201cYou mean the first place someone\u2019d look? How about that rock we were sitting on?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSounds great. Thanks again man.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cNo problem.\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> \u201cSo let me run through this shit again -\u201d I was crouched at the edge of a roof, shading my eyes against the goddamn setting sun. I\u2019d left Miranda about a half hour before after pulling the crystal from my bolthole. I started flipping a flat piece of stone. \u201cLiz is gonna Spiderman the goddamn titty lizard and pull her up here. Jack\u2019s gonna lay her the hell out. The g-man\u2019s on general lookout and I\u2019m the fucking spotter.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAre we going to let her have a nice dinner first?\u201d Liz asked.<br /> <br /> I chuckled. \u201cNah. I think it'll be best if she stood him up. It sure as fuck won\u2019t be the first time.\u201d<br /> <br /> Right on time, a car pulled up and she got out. There were four others in the car who stayed there as it sat idling. Nothing for it, so we went ahead with the goddamn plan. Clytemnestra grabbed her with no problems and Jack knocked her out quickly, even if it took two hits.<br /> <br /> Clytemnestra hid a smile. \u201cWell, I heard a distinct \u2018well ain\u2019t that a bitch\u2019 coming from the car. They\u2019re debating leaving.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cLet\u2019s hurry that shit along.\u201d I tossed my flat stone to Billy Mack, who caught it at the last minute. \u201cThink you could pull one of your misdirection tricks and make this super fucking scary?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI think I see your plan.\u201d He lined up the shot and slung the stone.<br /> <br /> The rock bounced off a wall then a car, whose alarm started. It winged past Bobby as he, his goddamn chest rug, black belt and the best fucking flowers that gas station had to offer climbed out of his car. Finally, just as the passenger in the reptoid\u2019s car opened the door, the rock hit the street lamp just above it, causing it to explode in sparks. The passenger door slammed shut as the driver fucking gunned it.<br /> <br /> \u201cCongratulations Billy Mack. They think it\u2019s aliens.\u201d Clytemnestra smiled at the g-man.<br /> <br /> I rolled my eyes and opened my bolthole so Jack could put the reptoid in it. Liz stopped him before he got there and fucking bit the busty woman, draining some of her Aether. I tapped my foot, waiting. As I came back, my phone buzzed with a text from Miranda. \u2018I\u2019m fine.\u2019<br /> <br /> Another message followed it up quickly. \u2018Don\u2019t come near the house for a bit.\u2019<br /> <br /> \u2018Even if you hear something happened here.\u2019<br /> <br /> \u2018I\u2019m fine.\u2019<br /> <br /> I blinked and sent a message back. \u2018I trust you and you know, no matter how dangerous it is, I can make it through to you.\u2019<br /> <br /> \u2018It\u2019s much safer here for me than you.\u2019 I ran my fingers through my fucking hair. The picture that came next didn\u2019t help. A doll\u2019s head with tendrils of pure goddamn darkness that ended in mouths dominated the image. A leg was dangling out of one mouth.<br /> <br /> \u2018Do I want to know who that is?\u2019 I took a swig from my flask.<br /> <br /> There was a pause. \u2018No.\u2019 Another pause. \u2018It\u2019s singing.\u2019 I let out a deep breath. \u2018It can\u2019t hurt ME.\u2019<br /> <br /> \u2018I trust you to both be safe and call for help if you need it.\u2019 I tapped my flask on my fucking leg.<br /> <br /> \u201cIs everything OK, Gabe?\u201d Billy Mack asked.<br /> <br /> I ran my fingers through my hair. \u201cUh...\u201d<br /> <br /> Billy Mack eyed me. \u201cYou\u2019re hesitating - what\u2019s wrong?\u201d I made vague agreeing noises and showed him my goddamn phone. \u201cSo you and Miranda got a pet. It looks like it might need house training.\u201d<br /> <br /> I rolled my eyes at him, but something about what he\u2019d said triggered a memory. \u2018Did that show up because you needed help? Like with your ex?\u2019<br /> <br /> \u2018Yes.\u2019 Her response came quickly and made me feel a hell of a lot better. \u201cGuard dog, maybe. It makes sense. She was dealing with the crystal. That language it spoke was Atlantean, apparently - she thought only mages could hear it.\u201d<br /> <br /> Terry scratched his fucking head. \u201cSo there was this dude, named Kyle, at my apartment... he heard it. He thought that thing was speaking Latin. I mean, obviously it wasn\u2019t Latin...\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAre these texts distracting you in a way that you don\u2019t need to be distracted?\u2019 Just what his shithole needed, a mage.<br /> <br /> \u2018You always distract me babe <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />\u2019<br /> <br /> I smirked. \u2018Do all mages speak Atlantean?\u2019<br /> <br /> \u2018Generally.\u2019<br /> <br /> \u2018So if someone heard the crystal and wasn\u2019t a mage...?\u2019<br /> <br /> There was a pause. \u2018A Demon? I didn\u2019t know anyone but mages could hear it, though I\u2019ve not dealt with it before - the Free Council was keeping it under wraps.\u2019<br /> <br /> I told the others what she told me and responded, \u2018Thanks beautiful.\u2019<br /> <br /> Clytemnestra looked at Terry. \u201cWhat do you know about this Kyle?\u201d<br /> <br /> He put his arm out straight, fucking palm down. \u201cHe\u2019s about this tall. You mean you\u2019ve never seen Kyle?\u201d Clytemnestra webbed his arms to his sides.<br /> <br /> \u201cYou should get a look at his aura.\u201d Billy Mack looked goddamn significantly at me.<br /> <br /> \u201cGreat. So I have to meet another friend of Terry\u2019s and probably go by his shithole to do it. Fucking swell.\u201d I cracked my neck.<br /> <br /> Billy Mack looked thoughtful. \u201cI suppose he could be some sort of spirit, as well as a Demon or an Angel.\u201d<br /> <br /> I shook my head. \u201cNah. Terry talked with the fucking Machine and said the God Machine\u2019s policy was hands off that place. So no Angel.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSo God really had turned his back on it.\u201d Jack gave me a wry smile.<br /> <br /> \u201cTurned his back and said fuck that shit.\u201d I took a swig from my flask. \u201cI\u2019m getting tapped. Clytemnestra, can I hit the hookah, or should I grab a phone or two?\u201d<br /> <br /> She waved me on. \u201cTake all you need.\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> \u201cHey Mack.\u201d I called him on the way to Liz\u2019s.<br /> <br /> \u201cGabe. Everything alright?\u201d He spoke quietly and was moving around quickly.<br /> <br /> I chuckled. \u201cAm I getting you out of Dancing with the Stars?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYeah, that sounds complicated.\u201d His volume was slightly fucking elevated. \u201cGimme all the details.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cRight. It\u2019s actually a pretty quick question. I heard something in the news about some fucking cultists at the Metropolitan Museum. They sounded like some guys that have been hassling a friend.\u201d<br /> <br /> He grunted, speaking in a more normal tone. \u201cYeah, that was some weird sh- crap.\u201d<br /> <br /> I nodded. \u201cWhat\u2019s the name of the guy heading that up? I thought I could have a talk with him, see if there\u2019s anything that would help either of us.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSure.\u201d He smiled. \u201cThat\u2019s Con- I mean, Donovan McCloud. He\u2019s a good guy, a department veteran. Hell, he\u2019s better with a sword than a gun, and not shabby with that. We call him Connor, cause of the sword thing.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThanks man, I appreciate it.\u201d<br /> <br /> He sighed. \u201cThat all? No other questions, that might take, I dunno, 15, 20 minutes to cover?\u201d<br /> <br /> I smirked. \u201cSorry Mack, that\u2019s all I got. You take care of yourself, and enjoy the dancing.\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Clytemnestra\u2019s Yarns</b><br /> <br /> Have to go to work Kayla? That sucks.<br /> <br /> Yeah.<br /> <br /> Hell of a day though right? Who would have thought Din-Dins would have shown up after betraying two cults\u2026at least.<br /> <br /> Ballsy? I don\u2019t know. That implies he had any idea what he was doing. I am unconvinced of this. Also, driving around with stolen kids. I tell you people are super protective of their rugrats, I have found.<br /> <br /> Yeah, it\u2019s weird.<br /> <br /> So the Titty Lizard thing. Apparently Bobby Right the insanely sleazy owner of Maverick\u2019s\u2026okay co-owner, and his ex wife are being targeted by someone who wants to turn them into reptoids. They did this by having one of their less talented members disguise as a busty teen looking for help. And of course skeevbag was sleazy enough to go for it.<br /> <br /> Yeah. Gross. I only go there as Naomi so he won\u2019t hit on me. Maybe Gabe being a dyke is why they get along.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I webbed her and pulled her on top of a building.<br /> <br /> Yeah there she was, then there she wasn\u2019t. That rather terrified the other reptoids. <br /> <br /> Quietus knocked her out\u2026eventually and they put her in Speed\u2019s personal realm. It is getting full, I imagine. Of course the boys wanted to torture her.<br /> <br /> I know, right? Ugh! Even Chow wanted to torture her.<br /> <br /> Ugh Men!<br /> <br /> What?<br /> <br /> Oh don\u2019t you start now.<br /> <br /> What?<br /> <br /> What\u2019s so wrong with me wanting to eat Midnight Snack anyway? It\u2019s not like I\u2026<br /> <br /> What?<br /> <br /> Look, the reason most of you is not in my stomach at any given time is because I love you. As much as I would enjoy consuming you, It is more important that you are alive. I am rather attached.<br /> <br /> But\u2026<br /> <br /> This is crazy. Calling\u2026.him\u2026food names is no reason for you to\u2026<br /> <br /> Okay. Sorry. I am new at this.<br /> <br /> How about not in front of you. Deal?<br /> <br /> Okay.<br /> <br /> Anyway, You, my love, have yourself a very wonderful night. I will be busy, but I promise to be thinking of you\u2026<br /> <br /> Yea, watching Nikka at Kiki\u2019s. <br /> <br /> Okay drive carefully sweetheart.<br /> <br /> Love You too!<br /> <i><br /> End Session XLVII</i><br /> <br /> Well then!<br /> <br /> Terry used Cooler Heads Prevail to keep the Cultists from fighting. The flickering lights were a glitch he manifested going Demon Form, and he used Urban Fluidity to teleport about.<br /> <br /> It is true that the language is \u201cHigh Speech\u201d not Atlantean. Miranda Asbury was sort of translating. As for Kyle, I recommend not doing what Terry was doing there at the end in public.<br /> <br /> Speaking of the end, Clytemnestra used Teather to grab the Reptoid, and Sonic Acuity to evesdrop. <br /> <br /> Oh lets see\u2026past that not much needs clarifying. I don\u2019t think. If anything is unclear let me know. Comments and Questions welcome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T12:32:05-07:00","id":950175,"title":"","content":"Oh Terry, what have you done? Let\u2019s find out.<br /> <br /> Moving the story along, we see more of the orchestration of the night\u2019s events, and chaos follows. Clytemnestra is a story again, taking place after the end of Speed\u2019s log.<br /> <br /> I should note there is some vile language in this journal. Mostly because of Kyle. No seriously.<br /> <br /> <i>Session XLVIII</i><br /> <br /> <b>Speed Demon\u2019s Monologues</b><br /> <br /> A rooster glared down at Terry from his perch on the tree outside the mechanic\u2019s apartment. He found the key under a rock where Kyle had said he\u2019d put it and headed upstairs to check out his new digs in the shithole. The second thing he noticed there were the fucking large amounts of blood soaking into the floor and splattered on the wall. The first was the tall shadowy figure sitting in one of the kitchen\u2019s high back chairs.<br /> <br /> \u201cAh, Terry.\u201d Louis stood and turned towards the other Demon.<br /> <br /> \u201cYou have me at a disadvantage, sir. Do you, uh, do you live here?\u201d Terry looked around wide eyed.<br /> <br /> Louis raised a goddamn eyebrow. \u201cNo. I came to your other apartment to find you. The disheveled gentleman assured me you were dead, but reading his mind indicated otherwise. He is an odd person.\u201d<br /> <br /> Terry took a seat and Louis followed after. \u201cI can only imagine. Talking to him is pretty magical, in and of himself, so I guess plunging in there had to have been too.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWhile the execution wasn\u2019t what I would have hoped,\u201d Louis kept to his purpose fucking valiantly, \u201cthe fact is you were successful. So I am here so that you can put that crystal in my hand.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019ve been a little out of it recently...\u201d Terry trailed off questioningly.<br /> <br /> Louis sat back. \u201cHave you?\u201d<br /> <br /> Terry shrugged. \u201cSo which side of the fence are you? The Jesus-Devil guys or the end of the world ones?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cDo we not have perfect memory? I am Valefar. You can call me Louis, when we are in public.\u201d The goddamn shadows shifted.<br /> <br /> \u201cYou heard of chaos spirits, yeah?\u201d Terry rubbed the back of his neck.<br /> <br /> Louis got a fucking wry look on his face. \u201cI am aware of Mr. McKraken.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cMr. McKraken. Good to know.\u201d Terry nodded. \u201cSee, I don\u2019t have a big handle on what happened recently.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThen let me remind you. We made a deal,\u201d Louis began.<br /> <br /> Terry hrmed sagely. \u201cPlease, please continue.\u201d<br /> <br /> Louis looked at him. \u201cUsing the agents Mr. McKraken had been attempting to influence, we put together a heist so that you could remove the Eye from the museum, which you did, once I eliminated the wards the mages had placed. In the meantime, to ensure the chaos spirit wasn\u2019t a problem, I brought in a pair of werewolves, who are tracking him throughout the city. Of course, to keep that perpetual motion machine going, I\u2019ve had to arrange a number of coincidences so they do not find him and he does not get too far ahead. Thus keeping him out of our hair long