id passing for Bobby behind the bar. Kyle waved at Jack. \u201cHey!\u201d Kyle saluted him with his Corona. \u201cCorona\u2019s are cheap tonight, grab a few.\u201d<br /> <br /> The Destroyer took a seat at the bar next to him and did order a beer. \u201cHey.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019m just chilling, looking for any Latinas to pass through.\u201d Kyle wiggled his fucking eyebrows at Jack.<br /> <br /> \u201cRight.\u201d Jack sighed inwardly.<br /> <br /> \u201cSo I got a friend that\u2019s selling a car. Need a car? You\u2019ll have to provide your own plates.\u201d<br /> <br /> Jack raised an eyebrow. \u201cActually... I could kinda use one.\u201d Kyle gave him a number he was asking for a Nissan Sentra. It was a damned low number, just in case Jack wasn't fully aware how hot the thing had to have been. \u201cSo where am I gonna meet you?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAt the apartment building. Tomorrow, say 10? I don\u2019t want it to be too early, in case I have a Spanish honey. Don\u2019t want to just kick them out, you know?\u201d He nudged Jack with his elbow.<br /> <br /> \u201cSounds good.\u201d That done, Jack looked at him sideways. \u201cSo, has Terry talked to you about being special?\u201d<br /> <br /> Kyle\u2019s eyes widened. \u201cUh, man, I like Latinas, you know?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019m not hitting on you,\u201d Jack growled out at him. \u201cI mean, do you have any special abilities?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI might have super hearing. Comes from being dropped on my head as a child.\u201d He waved at a pair of Latinas walking by. They ignored him.<br /> <br /> Jack sent me a text. \u2018I found Kyle. He still doesn\u2019t know.\u2019<br /> <br /> I groaned. Alibi\u2019d Billy Mack looked at me with concern. \u2018OK...\u2019<br /> <br /> \u2018Should I explain it to him?\u2019<br /> <br /> I frowned at my phone. \u2018Why the fuck would you want to do that?\u2019<br /> <br /> He rolled his eyes. \u2018Cause it can\u2019t hurt to have one on our side.\u2019<br /> <br /> \u2018Him?\u2019<br /> <br /> \u2018You know another one?\u2019 Jack took a swig of his beer.<br /> <br /> I snorted. \u2018More than one. You do too. And even if I didn\u2019t... him? Do whatever the fuck you want though buddy. But he\u2019s your goddamn responsibility if you do.\u2019<br /> <br /> Kyle made eyes at another group of Latinas. \u201cHey there. Can I buy any of you senoritas a Corona?\u201d Kyle whispered to Jack behind his hand. \u201cI don\u2019t actually know what that means.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYou keep working the ladies Kyle.\u201d Jack nodded to him and made a stop by Bobby on his way out. \u201cEverything going alright?\u201d<br /> <br /> Reptoid Bobby nodded. \u201cNothing unusual, suspicious or anything.\u201d He looked down the bar. \u201cI noticed you were speaking to Kyle. Very kind of you. I don\u2019t. He suggested butt-chugging night, last time I made the mistake to. I told him our schedule was too full.\u201d<br /> <br /> Jack rubbed a hand over his goddamn face. \u201cI\u2019m not surprised. He may be a cadet in training, so to speak.\u201d<br /> <br /> Bobby made a face. \u201cWhat kind of powers does he have?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cHell if I know.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cKnow what he doesn\u2019t have? Pheromones.\u201d Bobby shook his head.<br /> <br /> Kyle managed to grab a Latina\u2019s attention, and gestured at his crotch. \u201cWanna visit south of the border?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cDefinitely not.\u201d Bobby sighed.<br /> <br /> <br /> Back at Kiki\u2019s, we were in for a quiet night. Billy Mack was split off as an Alibi and sitting with me. Naomi was there with Penelope and Am. Vivian had gotten set up at her usual table, with her usual spread of electronics, and gotten her usual kiss hello. She did keep looking over at Bobby Heartwood, the poor fuck who\u2019d saved the world from aliens, or some shit. Naomi, for his own part, kept trying to seduce herself a third girl, her heart set on some college girl sitting with two of the NGN boys.<br /> <br /> Other than us, there was a pair of vampires, the one who keeps mind fucking Jack and her princess friend. The hippies were both there, looking glum at the lack of their drug-dealing, rabbit-suit-wearing friend. The werecat was there also, and scanning the room more than I was, focusing on Vivian and Naomi, with a bit of an eye on Nikka.<br /> <br /> When Jack showed up, Louise was eying Naomi and Bobby was getting menaced away from the vampire table. Jack grabbed himself a drink at the bar, and had one sent over to Louise as well, with a note saying \u2018She\u2019s not worth it.\u2019 His bartender contact, Roadrash, nodded to him. \u201cHey man! We are open again and it\u2019s good to be back.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYou are.\u201d Jack smiled. \u201cSeen anything interesting?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cNot much. The Chinese folks haven\u2019t been back since we closed. They seem to have taken their attempted murder poorly. We still don\u2019t know who was behind that.\u201d He shrugged. \u201cThere\u2019s something going down between these three women - a leggy blond... Anderson, I think... had a meeting with a very pretty black lady, wears a suit and an Indian? lady. Last Wednesday.\u201d<br /> <br /> Jack made a goddamn thoughtful face. We\u2019d seen Anderson with Zelda, who could have been mistaken for Indian if you crossed your eyes and threw a dart at the wall of ethnicities. Apparently the party had grown larger once we left. \u201cInteresting does fit.\u201d He looked around the room. \u201cWhat\u2019s the deal with the not-at-all out of a bottle blonde over there?\u201d<br /> <br /> Roadrash took a peek. \u201cIntimidating lady. Uh... reasonable temper. Doesn\u2019t make trouble. She talks with a bunch of different sorts. I\u2019m guessing those two are old friends? They have that kind of vibe. Definitely not a romantic conversation.<br /> <br /> \u201cWorks for me.\u201d Jack to